ostlier than manual transmission (MT) repairs.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm disappointed with the slow response time I experienced on your website.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will investigate and work to improve our website\\u2019s performance.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"8\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What regular maintenance practices should I follow to achieve good mileage for my car?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Follow Service Schedules: Stick to the manufacturer's recommended service intervals for oil changes, air filter replacements, and other checks.\\\",\\n        \\\"Use Genuine Parts: Always use genuine Aventro spare parts for optimal performance (e.g., Air Filter, Spark Plug, Oil Filter).\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To maintain good mileage, follow service schedules by sticking to the manufacturer's recommended service intervals for oil changes, air filter replacements, and other checks, and use genuine Aventro spare parts such as Air Filter, Spark Plug, and Oil Filter.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How often should I check my tyre pressure, and what are some smart driving habits that can optimize my car's mileage?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Check Tyre Pressure: Inspect tyre pressure at least once a month and before long trips.\\\",\\n        \\\"Smart Driving Habits: Maintain Steady Speeds: Use cruise control on highways if available; Plan Routes: Avoid congested routes which lead to excessive stop-start driving.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"You should inspect your tyre pressure at least once a month and before long trips. Smart driving habits include maintaining steady speeds using cruise control on highways and planning routes to avoid congested areas.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide a step-by-step guide on how to extend my car's mileage using regular maintenance and efficient driving techniques?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Follow Service Schedules: Stick to the manufacturer's recommended service intervals for oil changes, air filter replacements, and other checks.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check Tyre Pressure: Inspect tyre pressure at least once a month and before long trips.\\\",\\n        \\\"Drive Smoothly: Avoid Sudden Acceleration or Braking; Use Gentle Throttle Inputs.\\\",\\n        \\\"Limit Idling: Turn Off Engine at Long Stops; Use Start-Stop Feature If Equipped.\\\",\\n        \\\"Maintain Alignment and Suspension: Wheel Alignment: Misaligned wheels can drag and reduce mileage; Suspension Health: Worn-out suspension components affect efficiency.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Step 1: Follow service schedules by adhering to the manufacturer's recommended intervals for oil changes, air filter replacements, and other checks. Step 2: Check your tyre pressure at least once a month and before long trips. Step 3: Drive smoothly by avoiding sudden acceleration or braking and using gentle throttle inputs. Step 4: Limit idling by turning off the engine at long stops and using the start-stop feature if available. Step 5: Maintain proper wheel alignment and suspension to prevent drag and inefficiency.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are your recommendations for reducing excess weight and ensuring good battery health for better mileage?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Reduce Excess Weight: Remove Unnecessary Items: Extra load in the boot or cabin means more work for your engine; Avoid Unused Racks: Roof boxes or roof racks can reduce aerodynamic efficiency.\\\",\\n        \\\"Monitor Battery Health (For Hybrids & Electrics): Regular Battery Checks: Ensure the battery pack is in good health to maximize the range; Use Fast Charging Sparingly: Reserve fast-charging for emergencies to prolong battery life.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"It is recommended to remove unnecessary items and avoid unused racks to reduce excess weight, and for hybrids and electrics, regularly check the battery and use fast charging sparingly to maintain good battery health.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Even after following all the recommended practices, my mileage seems poor. Could misaligned wheels or suspension issues be causing this problem?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Maintain Alignment and Suspension: Wheel Alignment: Misaligned wheels can drag and reduce mileage.\\\",\\n        \\\"Maintain Alignment and Suspension: Suspension Health: Worn-out suspension components (like Shock Absorbers) affect efficiency.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Yes, misaligned wheels which can drag and worn-out suspension components like shock absorbers can affect efficiency and reduce mileage.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"AC ain't cooling my ride, and fastchargin makes battery drain so quick. whatz u do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Use Air Conditioning Wisely: AC Usage: Use Air Conditioning only when necessary as it can put extra load on the engine.\\\",\\n        \\\"Monitor Battery Health (For Hybrids & Electrics): Use Fast Charging Sparingly: Reserve fast-charging for emergencies to prolong battery life.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For the AC, use it only when necessary to avoid extra load on the engine, and for the battery, reserve fast-charging for emergencies to prolong its life.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I heard another brand offers mileage tips. Does Aventro really provide expert maintenance support?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Service Tip: Visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for a mileage check-up and expert maintenance.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Yes, Aventro provides expert maintenance support; you can visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for a mileage check-up and expert maintenance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I think your mileage tips page needs more images and visual guides.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will look into it.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"9\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm having trouble starting my Aventro engine; could it be a battery issue? What symptoms should I look for?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Symptoms: No lights\\/display, slow\\/absent cranking sounds, clicking noise.\\\",\\n        \\\"Try using headlights or infotainment; if dim or off, battery may be the culprit.\\\",\\n        \\\"If available, try jump-starting with a healthy battery.\\\",\\n        \\\"For Electric variants: Ensure Battery Pack has adequate charge. Attempt Fast Charging if possible.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"You should look for symptoms such as no lights\\/display, slow or absent cranking sounds, and clicking noise. Try using headlights or infotainment; if they are dim or off, the battery might be the culprit. If available, try jump-starting with a healthy battery, and for electric variants, ensure the Battery Pack has adequate charge, attempting Fast Charging if possible.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"My engine makes a clicking sound and I see a warning light on the dashboard. What could be the cause, and what should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Symptoms: Single click or silence, even with good battery.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check for blown fuses (refer to user manual location).\\\",\\n        \\\"Look for: Engine\\/Malfunction lights on dashboard.\\\",\\n        \\\"Rapid Clicking: Battery\\/starter issues.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The clicking sound might indicate starter motor issues and blown fuses, and the warning light suggests an engine\\/malfunction warning. You should check for blown fuses and inspect for rapid clicking which points to battery or starter issues.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide me with a step-by-step guide on diagnosing why my Aventro engine won't start?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Check the Basics: Ensure the car is in 'Park' (automatic) or 'Neutral' (manual).\\\",\\n        \\\"Steering Lock: Gently turn the steering wheel while turning the key if steering is locked.\\\",\\n        \\\"Key\\/Start Button: Switch ignition off and retry. For push-button start, press brake\\/clutch while starting.\\\",\\n        \\\"Battery Check: Inspect dashboard for dim or no lights. Try using headlights or infotainment; if dim or off, battery may be the culprit. If available, try jump-starting with a healthy battery. For Electric variants: Ensure Battery Pack has adequate charge. Attempt Fast Charging if possible.\\\",\\n        \\\"Fuel System Inspection: Check fuel gauge and fill if necessary. For Diesel Vehicles: Ensure there\\u2019s no air lock or recent filter change. For Hybrid\\/Electric: Ensure main battery charge is sufficient.\\\",\\n        \\\"Starter Motor & Electricals: Check for blown fuses (refer to user manual location). Test if interior lights stay bright when key is turned; if yes, suspect starter relay\\/motor.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check Engine Warning Lights: Look for Engine\\/Malfunction lights on dashboard.\\\",\\n        \\\"Listen for Sounds: Rapid Clicking indicates Battery\\/starter issues; Engine Cranking (but not starting) suggests fuel, ignition, or electrical problems; No Sound at all indicates Battery, ignition switch, or starter.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check Engine Components: Tighten loose\",\"10\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide detailed information about the Customer Support Associate position available at Aventro Motors?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Customer Support Associate\\\",\\n        \\\"Location: Gurugram, Haryana \\/ Work from Home\\\",\\n        \\\"Department: Customer Care\\\",\\n        \\\"Job Type: Full-time\\/Contract\\\",\\n        \\\"Handle customer inquiries about car models, servicing, and locations\\\",\\n        \\\"Provide assistance for insurance claims, roadside support, and maintenance booking\\\",\\n        \\\"Graduate in any stream\\\",\\n        \\\"Experience in customer service roles preferred\\\",\\n        \\\"Good command of English and Hindi\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Customer Support Associate position is located in Gurugram, Haryana \\/ Work from Home and is a Full-time\\/Contract role in the Customer Care department. Responsibilities include handling customer inquiries about car models, servicing, and locations, as well as providing assistance for insurance claims, roadside support, and maintenance booking. The qualifications require a graduate in any stream, with customer service experience preferred and a good command of English and Hindi.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you tell me about the Sales Executive and Service Technician (Electric Vehicles) openings, including their locations and the experience required for each?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Sales Executive\\\",\\n        \\\"Location: Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana\\\",\\n        \\\"Department: Sales & Marketing\\\",\\n        \\\"Job Type: Full-time\\\",\\n        \\\"Generate and manage leads for new car sales\\\",\\n        \\\"Explain features and advantages of Aventro models (Petrol, Diesel, Electric, Hybrid)\\\",\\n        \\\"Build and maintain customer relationships\\\",\\n        \\\"Achieve monthly and quarterly sales targets\\\",\\n        \\\"Graduate (any discipline)\\\",\\n        \\\"1-2 years automotive sales experience preferred\\\",\\n        \\\"Excellent communication and presentation skills\\\",\\n        \\\"Service Technician (Electric Vehicles)\\\",\\n        \\\"Location: Okhla Industrial Area, New Delhi \\/ Electronic City, Bengaluru\\\",\\n        \\\"Department: After Sales Service\\\",\\n        \\\"Job Type: Full-time\\\",\\n        \\\"Diagnose and repair electric vehicle systems (battery, motor, electronics)\\\",\\n        \\\"Perform regular maintenance and system checks\\\",\\n        \\\"Coordinate with technical teams for problem resolution\\\",\\n        \\\"ITI\\/Diploma in Automobile\\/Electrical\\/Mechanical Engineering\\\",\\n        \\\"Experience in servicing electric\\/hybrid vehicles preferred\\\",\\n        \\\"Strong technical troubleshooting skills\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Sales Executive role is located at Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana and is a full-time position in the Sales & Marketing department, requiring a graduate (any discipline) with 1-2 years of automotive sales experience and excellent communication skills. The Service Technician (Electric Vehicles) position is located in Okhla Industrial Area, New Delhi \\/ Electronic City, Bengaluru, is a full-time role in the After Sales Service department, and requires an ITI\\/Diploma in Automobile\\/Electrical\\/Mechanical Engineering along with experience in servicing electric\\/hybrid vehicles.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What steps should I follow to apply for a job at Aventro Motors?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Send your updated resume and cover letter to: careers@aventromotors.com\\\",\\n        \\\"Please mention the position and location applied for in the subject line\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To apply for a job at Aventro Motors, send your updated resume and cover letter to careers@aventromotors.com and make sure to mention the position and location you are applying for in the subject line.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is your opinion on Aventro Motors' approach to innovation and career growth?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Work with cutting-edge automotive technologies (Petrol, Diesel, Electric, Hybrid)\\\",\\n        \\\"Be part of a vibrant and diverse team\\\",\\n        \\\"Opportunities for professional growth and training\\\",\\n        \\\"Competitive compensation and benefits\\\",\\n        \\\"Pan-India presence with offices and service centers across the country\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors offers the opportunity to work with cutting-edge automotive technologies, be part of a vibrant and diverse team, and benefit from professional growth and training, along with competitive compensation and a pan-India presence.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I tried submitting my application via email but received a bounce-back error. Is there a specific format I should follow when sending my resume?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Send your updated resume and cover letter to: careers@aventromotors.com\\\",\\n        \\\"Please mention the position and location applied for in the subject line\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Please ensure you send your updated resume and cover letter to careers@aventromotors.com and include the position and location in the subject line as requested.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"ay car pls, where 2 apply??\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Send your updated resume and cover letter to: careers@aventromotors.com\\\",\\n        \\\"Please mention the position and location applied for in the subject line\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Please send your updated resume and cover letter to careers@aventromotors.com and include the position and location in the subject line.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does Aventro Motors' benefits compare with what's available in the industry?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Work with cutting-edge automotive technologies (Petrol, Diesel, Electric, Hybrid)\\\",\\n        \\\"Be part of a vibrant and diverse team\\\",\\n        \\\"Opportunities for professional growth and training\\\",\\n        \\\"Competitive compensation and benefits\\\",\\n        \\\"Pan-India presence with offices and service centers across the country\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors provides competitive compensation and benefits, along with the opportunity to work with cutting-edge automotive technologies, be part of a vibrant and diverse team, and access professional growth and training opportunities, supported by a pan-India presence.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"The application process is really confusing and the website is difficult to navigate.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will look into your concerns and work on improving our application process and website navigation.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"11\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide the pricing details for the Engine Assembly part?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engine Assembly      | 85,000           | Complete engine, varies with model & fuel type\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Engine Assembly is priced at 85,000 INR and is described as a complete engine that varies with model and fuel type.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are the unit prices for the Battery Pack and Transmission, and could you explain the differences mentioned?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Battery Pack         | 1,20,000         | High voltage for EVs\\/Hybrids; Lead-acid ~6,000\\\",\\n        \\\"Transmission         | 70,000           | Automatic costlier than manual\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Battery Pack costs 1,20,000 INR and is noted for high voltage for EVs\\/Hybrids with a lead-acid option around 6,000, while the Transmission is priced at 70,000 INR with a note indicating that the automatic version is costlier than the manual one.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide step-by-step guidance on availing the Fast Charging service for electric vehicles?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Fast Charging (Electric Vehicles)| 600 \\/ session  | Up to 80% charge, may vary by location\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For Fast Charging (Electric Vehicles), the service is priced at 600 INR per session and offers up to 80% charge, with the cost varying by location.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are your thoughts on the value of the Infotainment System, and how does its repair differ from a complete replacement?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Infotainment System  | 25,000           |\\\",\\n        \\\"Infotainment Repair  | 3,500          | Software & basic hardware (major repairs extra)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Infotainment System is listed at 25,000 INR, while the Infotainment Repair service is offered at 3,500 INR for software and basic hardware issues, with major repairs costing extra.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm encountering an error when trying to schedule a tyre replacement online. Can you help me troubleshoot?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For exact prices and appointments, contact your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Please contact your nearest Aventro Service Center for assistance with scheduling and resolving the error.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Yo, my AC Servce cost info seems off, can u pls double-check? ty.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"AC Service                       | 2,200          | Includes refrigerant refill, filter clean\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The AC Service is priced at 2,200 INR and includes a refrigerant refill and filter clean.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How do your Engine Assembly prices compare to those offered by other manufacturers?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engine Assembly      | 85,000           | Complete engine, varies with model & fuel type\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Our Engine Assembly is priced at 85,000 INR and is described as a complete engine that varies with model and fuel type.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Your website is a bit hard to navigate.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will investigate and work to improve our website\\u2019s performance.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"12\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide detailed information on the Aventro Motors auto loan process and list all the required documents for the loan application?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Select Your Car: Choose your favorite Aventro Motors model and variant at our showroom or website.\\\",\\n        \\\"Apply for Loan: Fill in a simple online\\/offline loan application form at the dealership or on our website. Provide basic documents (ID, address proof, income proof, bank statement).\\\",\\n        \\\"Choose Loan Partner: Our finance advisors help you pick the best bank\\/offer as per your eligibility & preferences.\\\",\\n        \\\"Quick Approval: Get instant\\/within 24-hour approval for eligible candidates.\\\",\\n        \\\"Loan Disbursement: Bank credits the loan amount directly to Aventro Motors for seamless vehicle delivery.\\\",\\n        \\\"Drive Away: Take delivery of your new Aventro Motors car!\\\",\\n        \\\"- Identity Proof (Aadhaar Card, Passport, etc.)\\\",\\n        \\\"- Address Proof (Utility Bill, Rent Agreement, etc.)\\\",\\n        \\\"- Income Proof (Salary Slip\\/IT Returns)\\\",\\n        \\\"- Bank Statements (last 6 months)\\\",\\n        \\\"- Passport-size photographs\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The loan process starts with selecting your car, then applying for a loan by filling the application form and providing basic documents (ID, address proof, income proof, bank statement). Next, you choose a loan partner with the help of finance advisors, get quick approval within 24 hours, have the loan amount disbursed directly to Aventro Motors, and finally drive away with your new car. The required documents include Identity Proof, Address Proof, Income Proof, Bank Statements, and Passport-size photographs.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you compare the loan offers from Matrix Bank and SecureFirst Bank, and also explain the sample EMI calculation provided?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Matrix Bank: Interest Rate (p.a.) 7.99% - 9.5%, Loan Tenure Up to 7 years, Maximum Loan Amount 90% of car value, Processing Fee \\u20b92,500 or 0.5%, Special Benefits Instant approval, minimal docs\\\",\\n        \\\"SecureFirst Bank: Interest Rate (p.a.) 9.10% - 11.2%, Loan Tenure Up to 6 years, Maximum Loan Amount 100% of car value, Processing Fee \\u20b91,500 or 0.4%, Special Benefits Flexible EMI, festive discounts\\\",\\n        \\\"Sample EMI Calculator: Car Price: \\u20b910,00,000, Loan Amount: \\u20b98,50,000 (85% of value), Interest Rate: 9% p.a., Loan Tenure: 5 years, Monthly EMI \\u20b917,637\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Matrix Bank offers a loan with an interest rate between 7.99% and 9.5% per annum, a tenure of up to 7 years, a maximum loan amount of 90% of the car value, a processing fee of \\u20b92,500 or 0.5%, and features instant approval with minimal docs. In contrast, SecureFirst Bank provides an interest rate between 9.10% and 11.2% per annum, a tenure of up to 6 years, a maximum loan amount of 100% of the car value, a processing fee of \\u20b91,500 or 0.4%, and offers flexible EMI options with festive discounts. Additionally, the sample EMI calculation shows that for a car price of \\u20b910,00,000, a loan amount of \\u20b98,50,000 at 9% p.a. for 5 years results in a monthly EMI of \\u20b917,637.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you guide me step-by-step on how to apply for an Aventro Motors auto loan online?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Select Your Car: Choose your favorite Aventro Motors model and variant at our showroom or website.\\\",\\n        \\\"Apply for Loan: Fill in a simple online\\/offline loan application form at the dealership or on our website. Provide basic documents (ID, address proof, income proof, bank statement).\\\",\\n        \\\"Choose Loan Partner: Our finance advisors help you pick the best bank\\/offer as per your eligibility & preferences.\\\",\\n        \\\"Quick Approval: Get instant\\/within 24-hour approval for eligible candidates.\\\",\\n        \\\"Loan Disbursement: Bank credits the loan amount directly to Aventro Motors for seamless vehicle delivery.\\\",\\n        \\\"Drive Away: Take delivery of your new Aventro Motors car!\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To apply for an Aventro Motors auto loan online, first select your car from the showroom or website. Next, fill in the online loan application form and provide the necessary documents such as ID, address proof, income proof, and bank statement. Then, consult with finance advisors to choose the best bank offer, after which you'll receive quick approval within 24 hours. Once approved, the bank will disburse the loan amount directly to Aventro Motors and you can drive away with your new car.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your opinion, which bank would be the best choice if I want a fast and hassle-free loan approval for my Aventro Motors car?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Matrix Bank: Special Benefits Instant approval, minimal docs\\\",\\n        \\\"Union Credit: Special Benefits Special EV rates, quick funding\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Matrix Bank, with its instant approval and minimal documentation, appears to be a great choice for a fast and hassle-free loan approval.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm encountering issues while trying to submit my online loan application; the system keeps throwing errors and not accepting my documents. What can I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Need Assistance? Contact our Finance Desk at any Aventro Motors showroom or email us at [info@aventromotors.com](mailto:info@aventromotors.com)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If you're facing issues with your online loan application, please contact our Finance Desk at any Aventro Motors showroom or email us at info@aventromotors.com for assistance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Hey, how do I get a loan for my Aventro car? i need fast appvl, pls help!\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Apply for Loan: Fill in a simple online\\/offline loan application form at the dealership or on our website. Provide basic documents (ID, address proof, income proof, bank statement).\\\",\\n        \\\"Quick Approval: Get instant\\/within 24-hour approval for eligible candidates.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To get a loan for your Aventro car, fill in the loan application form online or at the dealership with the required documents, and you should receive an instant or within 24-hour approval if eligible.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How do Aventro Motors' loan offers and process compare with those available at other car dealerships?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Purchasing your dream Aventro Motors car is now easier than ever with our quick and hassle-free auto loan solutions, in partnership with leading banks.\\\",\\n        \\\"Partner Banks & Loan Offers: Matrix Bank offers instant approval, minimal docs; Astra Finance offers pre-closure at zero charges; SecureFirst Bank offers flexible EMI, festive discounts; Union Credit offers special EV rates, quick funding; Modern India Bank provides online approval in 30 minutes.\\\",\\n        \\\"Easy Car Loan Process: Select Your Car, Apply for Loan, Choose Loan Partner, Quick Approval, Loan Disbursement, Drive Away.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors provides quick and hassle-free auto loan solutions through partnerships with leading banks. Our offers include benefits like Matrix Bank's instant approval with minimal docs, Astra Finance's pre-closure at zero charges, flexible EMI options from SecureFirst Bank, and more, supported by a streamlined process from selecting your car to driving it away.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I experienced a slow response time while trying to apply for a loan through your online system and I\\u2019m quite frustrated.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will investigate and work to improve our service.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"13\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How do I pair my smartwatch with my Aventro vehicle using the Aventro Connect app?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Ensure your smartwatch is paired with your smartphone via Bluetooth and both are connected to the Internet.\\\",\\n        \\\"On your smartwatch, open the relevant app store (Apple Watch App Store, Google Play for Wear OS, or Galaxy Store).\\\",\\n        \\\"Search for Aventro Connect and install it.\\\",\\n        \\\"On your smartphone\\u2019s Aventro Connect app, go to _Settings_ > _Device Connections_ > _Add Smartwatch_.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To pair your smartwatch, ensure it is paired with your smartphone via Bluetooth and both devices are connected to the Internet, install Aventro Connect from the relevant app store, then on your smartphone\\u2019s Aventro Connect app go to _Settings_ > _Device Connections_ > _Add Smartwatch_.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I need help with two things: first, how do I set up Apple CarPlay using both wired and wireless connections, and second, what should I do if CarPlay fails to connect?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Start your car and turn on the infotainment system.\\\",\\n        \\\"Plug your iPhone into the car\\u2019s USB port with a genuine Apple Lightning cable.\\\",\\n        \\\"CarPlay prompt will appear on your infotroainment display. Tap Allow on your iPhone if asked.\\\",\\n        \\\"Enable both Bluetooth and Wi-Fi on your iPhone.\\\",\\n        \\\"On the car\\u2019s infotainment display, go to _Settings_ > _Apple CarPlay_ > _Pair New Device_.\\\",\\n        \\\"On your iPhone, go to _Settings_ > _General_ > _CarPlay_ and select your Aventro car.\\\",\\n        \\\"Restart your iPhone and the infotainment system if CarPlay won\\u2019t connect.\\\",\\n        \\\"Use only Apple-certified cables for wired connections.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For Apple CarPlay, if using a wired connection, start your car, turn on the infotainment system, and plug your iPhone into the car\\u2019s USB port with a genuine Apple Lightning cable; a CarPlay prompt will appear and you should tap Allow. For a wireless connection, enable both Bluetooth and Wi-Fi on your iPhone, on the car\\u2019s display go to _Settings_ > _Apple CarPlay_ > _Pair New Device_, then on your iPhone go to _Settings_ > _General_ > _CarPlay_ and select your Aventro car. If CarPlay fails to connect, restart your iPhone and the infotainment system and ensure you are using Apple-certified cables for wired connections.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide step-by-step instructions on how to set up the Works with Alexa feature on my Aventro vehicle?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"On your smartphone, open the Amazon Alexa app.\\\",\\n        \\\"Tap the menu and select Skills & Games.\\\",\\n        \\\"Search for Aventro Motors (Aventro Connect Skill).\\\",\\n        \\\"Tap Enable.\\\",\\n        \\\"Log in with your Aventro Connect account to link it.\\\",\\n        \\\"Grant requested permissions (vehicle control, location, etc.).\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To set up Works with Alexa, open the Amazon Alexa app on your smartphone, tap the menu and select Skills & Games, search for Aventro Motors (Aventro Connect Skill), tap Enable, log in with your Aventro Connect account to link it, and grant the requested permissions such as vehicle control and location.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What do you think about the Apple CarPlay integration in Aventro vehicles, and would you recommend it?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Apple CarPlay seamlessly integrates your iPhone with your Aventro vehicle\\u2019s infotainment system.\\\",\\n        \\\"Use Maps, Music, Calls, and Messages hands-free.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Apple CarPlay integration seamlessly connects your iPhone with the Aventro vehicle\\u2019s infotainment system, allowing you to use Maps, Music, Calls, and Messages hands-free, which makes it a highly recommended feature.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm having trouble connecting my smartwatch to my Aventro vehicle. My phone shows a 'Failed to connect' message during pairing. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Make sure Bluetooth is enabled on both watch and phone.\\\",\\n        \\\"Both devices must be within range.\\\",\\n        \\\"Both devices must have an internet connection.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"You should ensure that Bluetooth is enabled on both your watch and phone, that both devices are within range, and that they have an internet connection.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"hw do i set up cply wirelss on my Aventro? plz hlp asap\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Enable both Bluetooth and Wi-Fi on your iPhone.\\\",\\n        \\\"On the car\\u2019s infotainment display, go to _Settings_ > _Apple CarPlay_ > _Pair New Device_.\\\",\\n        \\\"On your iPhone, go to _Settings_ > _General_ > _CarPlay_ and select your Aventro car.\\\",\\n        \\\"Follow on-screen instructions to pair wirelessly.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To set up wireless CarPlay, enable both Bluetooth and Wi-Fi on your iPhone, then on your car\\u2019s infotainment display go to _Settings_ > _Apple CarPlay_ > _Pair New Device_, and on your iPhone go to _Settings_ > _General_ > _CarPlay_ and select your Aventro car, following the on-screen instructions.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does Aventro's Smartwatch Connectivity feature compare to similar systems offered by other brands?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Smartwatch connectivity allows you to interact with select vehicle functions directly from your smartwatch.\\\",\\n        \\\"This may include lock\\/unlock, remote start, finding your car, and vehicle health reports.\\\",\\n        \\\"Compatible Smartwatches: Apple Watch (watchOS 6 and above), Android Wear OS Watches (Wear OS 2 and above), Samsung Galaxy Watches (Tizen 4 and above).\\\",\\n        \\\"On your smartphone, download the Aventro Connect app from Google Play Store or Apple App Store.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro's Smartwatch Connectivity allows you to interact with select vehicle functions such as lock\\/unlock, remote start, finding your car, and accessing vehicle health reports directly from your smartwatch, and it is compatible with Apple Watch (watchOS 6 and above), Android Wear OS Watches (Wear OS 2 and above), and Samsung Galaxy Watches (Tizen 4 and above) via the Aventro Connect app.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I appreciate the clear setup instructions in your guide, but I've experienced occasional app crashes. Just wanted to share my thoughts.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will look into your comments and aim to\",\"14\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you tell me what safety features are included in the Aventro Pulse Hatchback across all variants?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Safety Features: Dual airbags, ABS with EBD, Reverse Parking Sensors (on all variants)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Pulse Hatchback includes Dual airbags, ABS with EBD, and Reverse Parking Sensors (on all variants).\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are the available fuel options for the Aventro Pulse Hatchback, and what is the price of the Pulse Diesel ZX variant?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Available in: Petrol, Diesel, Electric, Hybrid\\\",\\n        \\\"| Pulse Diesel      | Diesel    | ZX    | 8.5         | 11\\\\\\\" Harman System, 360\\u00b0 Camera, ADAS L2, Leather Seats              |\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Pulse Hatchback is available in Petrol, Diesel, Electric, and Hybrid options. The Pulse Diesel ZX variant is priced at 8.5 Lakh.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide a step-by-step guide on how to schedule a test drive for the Aventro Pulse Hatchback?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For Test Drive or Enquiry\\\\n\\\\nMail: info@aventromotors.com  \\\\nCall: +91 124 1234567\\\\n\\\\nOr visit your nearest Aventro Service Center (Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru, Chennai, Hyderabad, Pune, Kolkata, and more...)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To schedule a test drive, you can email info@aventromotors.com, call +91 124 1234567, or visit your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your opinion, would the Aventro Pulse Hatchback be a good choice for city driving?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Pulse Hatchback is the perfect blend of peppy performance, efficiency, and feature-rich technology, making it an ideal city companion.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Pulse Hatchback is described as a perfect blend of peppy performance, efficiency, and feature-rich technology, making it an ideal choice for city driving.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I tried contacting customer support about a problem I encountered but didn't get a response. What should I do next?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Contact: +91 124 1234567\\\",\\n        \\\"Email: info@aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Please try reaching out again by calling +91 124 1234567 or emailing info@aventromotors.com for assistance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"whats up with the prc for the electrik variant? do u have disc on ev specs?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"| Pulse Electric    | Electric  | Base  | 12.5         | 7\\\\\\\" Touchscreen, Fast Charging Port                                  |\\\",\\n        \\\"| Pulse Electric    | Electric  | X     | 13.0         | 11\\\\\\\" Infotainment, ADAS L1, Fast Charging, Hill Start Assist         |\\\",\\n        \\\"| Pulse Electric    | Electric  | ZX    | 13.5         | 11\\\\\\\" Harman System, 360\\u00b0 Camera, ADAS L2, Leather Seats              |\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For the electric variants, the Pulse Electric Base is priced at 12.5 Lakh, the X variant at 13.0 Lakh, and the ZX variant at 13.5 Lakh. They feature specifications such as a 7\\\\\\\" Touchscreen with Fast Charging on the Base, 11\\\\\\\" Infotainment with ADAS L1 and Fast Charging (plus Hill Start Assist) on the X, and an 11\\\\\\\" Harman System with ADAS L2 on the ZX.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does the technology in the Aventro Pulse Hatchback compare to other hatchbacks when it comes to features and advanced systems?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Pulse Hatchback is the perfect blend of peppy performance, efficiency, and feature-rich technology, making it an ideal city companion.\\\",\\n        \\\"X Variant (From X for All Fuel Types)\\\\n\\\\n- 11-inch Infotainment System\\\\n- ADAS Level 1 (Lane Departure Warning, Collision Alert, Auto Emergency Braking)\\\\n- Rear View Camera\\\\n- Height Adjustable Driver Seat\\\",\\n        \\\"ZX Variant (From ZX for All Fuel Types)\\\\n\\\\n- 11-inch Infotainment System with Harman Premium Audio\\\\n- ADAS Level 2 (adds Adaptive Cruise, Lane Keep Assist, Traffic Sign Recognition)\\\\n- 360-Degree Surround View Camera\\\\n- Leather Upholstery\\\\n- Alloy Wheels\\\\n- Wireless Smartphone Connectivity\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Pulse Hatchback offers advanced technology with features like an 11-inch Infotainment System, ADAS Level 1 in the X variant, and ADAS Level 2 along with premium audio and 360-Degree Surround View Camera in the ZX variant, making it highly competitive in its feature set.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm disappointed with the recent changes in your website layout.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate your input.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"15\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What headlamp settings and precautions should I follow in foggy or rainy weather?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Always use low beam: High beams reflect off fog or rain, worsening visibility.\\\",\\n        \\\"Activate fog lamps if available: These cut through the mist close to the road.\\\",\\n        \\\"Use hazard lights only when stationary on road shoulder: Do not use hazards while driving as it confuses other road users.\\\",\\n        \\\"Reduce speed and increase distance: Wet roads mean longer stopping distances.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"In foggy or rainy weather, you should always use low beam, activate fog lamps if available, use hazard lights only when stationary on the road shoulder, and reduce speed and increase distance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you tell me the recommended headlamp settings for urban heavy traffic as well as for hilly roads?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Use low beam: High beams can dazzle oncoming drivers and should be avoided in city traffic.\\\",\\n        \\\"Turn on your headlamps in the evening\\/low light: Even if street lights are present, using your headlamps enhances visibility.\\\",\\n        \\\"Hazards & signal lights: Use these for extra safety during sudden traffic halts or in bumper-to-bumper situations.\\\",\\n        \\\"Always use dipper at turns and blind spots: Alert oncoming vehicles of your presence.\\\",\\n        \\\"High beam for long stretches at night: But revert to low beam for sharp turns or when climbing gradients.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For urban heavy traffic, use low beam, turn on your headlamps in low light, and use hazard and signal lights for extra safety. For hilly roads, always use dipped beams at turns and blind spots, and use high beam for long stretches at night before reverting to low beam for sharp turns or gradients.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide me with step-by-step instructions on how to maintain my headlamps?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Clean headlamp lenses regularly to maximize light output.\\\",\\n        \\\"Replace bulbs periodically as they dim with age, even if they haven\\u2019t fused.\\\",\\n        \\\"Ensure headlamp alignment as misaimed lights can dazzle drivers or impair your own view.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check all lighting systems before monsoons or long journeys.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Step-by-step, first clean headlamp lenses regularly to maximize light output, then replace bulbs periodically as they dim with age even if they haven\\u2019t fused, ensure headlamp alignment to avoid dazzle or impaired view, and finally check all lighting systems before monsoons or long journeys.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your opinion, what is the best headlamp setup for driving on rural highways?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Switch to high beam on poorly lit or empty stretches: Offers extended visibility where street lighting is absent.\\\",\\n        \\\"Dip your beam for oncoming vehicles: Always shift back to low beam to avoid blinding other drivers.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check for road signs: Many rural roads feature animal crossings or sharp curves\\u2014reduce speed and use dipped beams.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For rural highways, it is best to switch to high beam on poorly lit or empty stretches for extended visibility, dip your beam for oncoming vehicles to avoid blinding them, and always check for road signs indicating hazards.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm having an issue with my headlamps not turning on in the evening, even in urban traffic. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"If you have issues with your car\\u2019s headlamps, visit any Aventro Service Center or contact:\\\",\\n        \\\"Email: [info@aventromotors.com](mailto:info@aventromotors.com)\\\",\\n        \\\"Phone: +91 124 1234567\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If you're experiencing headlamp issues, please visit any Aventro Service Center or contact them via email at info@aventromotors\",\"16\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What does the Battery Warning Light indicate in my Aventro Motors vehicle?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Battery Warning Light: The battery is not charging properly. This could signal alternator failure, battery issues, or wiring problems.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Battery Warning Light indicates that the battery is not charging properly and could signal alternator failure, battery issues, or wiring problems.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I received an Engine Warning Light and an Oil Pressure Warning Light on my dashboard. What do they mean?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engine Warning Light (Check Engine): Indicates a problem with the engine or emissions control system. Immediate diagnosis is recommended.\\\",\\n        \\\"Oil Pressure Warning Light: Low oil pressure detected. Stop the engine and check oil levels to avoid engine damage.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Engine Warning Light indicates a problem with the engine or emissions control system and requires immediate diagnosis, while the Oil Pressure Warning Light means that low oil pressure has been detected and you should stop the engine and check the oil levels to avoid engine damage.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide step-by-step guidance on how to address the Brake System Warning Light?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Brake System Warning Light: Possible issues with the brake system such as low fluid, worn brake pads, or handbrake engaged.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Brake System Warning Light indicates there may be issues with the brake system such as low fluid, worn brake pads, or the handbrake being engaged. You should check the brake fluid level, inspect the brake pads for wear, and ensure that the handbrake is disengaged.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is your opinion on the comprehensiveness of the warning alerts system in Aventro Motors vehicles?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"The instrument cluster in Aventro Motors vehicles is designed to inform the driver about the status of various vehicle systems.\\\",\\n        \\\"Each symbol or indicator light provides information on system performance, potential malfunctions, or urgent warnings requiring immediate action.\\\",\\n        \\\"The warning alerts include indicators for engine, battery, oil pressure, brakes, ABS, airbag, coolant temperature, transmission, tire pressure, traction control, ESP\\/BAS, power steering, fuel level, glow plug, hybrid\\/electric system, service reminder, seatbelt reminder, door ajar, washer fluid, and high beam.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The warning alerts system in Aventro Motors vehicles is very comprehensive, as it provides detailed information on a wide range of systems including engine, battery, oil pressure, brakes, and more, ensuring drivers are well-informed about the vehicle's status and any potential issues.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I encountered a TPMS Light error message on my dashboard. What does this indicate?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS) Light: One or more tires have low pressure or there\\u2019s a sensor malfunction.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The TPMS Light indicates that one or more tires have low pressure or there is a sensor malfunction.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"tire pressr monitorng sys light on, plz help\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS) Light: One or more tires have low pressure or there\\u2019s a sensor malfunction.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS) Light means that one or more tires have low pressure or there is a sensor malfunction.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Why does Aventro Motors recommend contacting their service center when an Engine Warning Light appears, instead of handling it yourself like CarZone?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engine Warning Light (Check Engine): Indicates a problem with the engine or emissions control system. Immediate diagnosis is recommended.\\\",\\n        \\\"If any red warning light appears, stop the vehicle in a safe location as soon as possible and consult your Aventro Motors dealer or the owner's manual.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors recommends contacting a service center because the Engine Warning Light indicates a problem with the engine or emissions control system that requires immediate diagnosis, and if any red warning light appears, it is advised to stop the vehicle in a safe location and consult your dealer or owner's manual.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm disappointed with how the instrument cluster displays error messages.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"17\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are the key features of the ZX variant of the Aventro Spark Hatchback?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"11-inch touchscreen with Harman sound system\\\",\\n        \\\"360\\u00b0 Surround View Camera\\\",\\n        \\\"ADAS Level 2 (includes lane keep assist, adaptive cruise control)\\\",\\n        \\\"Leather seats\\\",\\n        \\\"Premium LED lighting\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The ZX variant features an 11-inch touchscreen with Harman sound system, a 360\\u00b0 Surround View Camera, ADAS Level 2 (includes lane keep assist, adaptive cruise control), leather seats, and premium LED lighting.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What engine options are available for the Aventro Spark, and what is the fuel tank capacity for the internal combustion engine variants?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engine Options: Petrol \\/ Diesel \\/ Electric \\/ Hybrid\\\",\\n        \\\"Fuel Tank Capacity: 40 Litres (IC engine variants)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Spark is available with Petrol, Diesel, Electric, and Hybrid engine options, and it has a fuel tank capacity of 40 Litres for the internal combustion engine variants.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you guide me through the process of selecting the right variant of Aventro Spark based on my needs?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Whether you opt for the practical Base, feature-rich X, or the technologically advanced ZX variant, you get reliability\\u2014a true value for your family.\\\",\\n        \\\"X Variant: 11-inch touchscreen infotainment system, ADAS Level 1 driver assists (auto emergency braking, rear collision warning), Automatic Climate control, Alloy Wheels\\\",\\n        \\\"ZX Variant: 11-inch touchscreen with Harman sound system, 360\\u00b0 Surround View Camera, ADAS Level 2 (includes lane keep assist, adaptive cruise control), Leather seats, Premium LED lighting\\\",\\n        \\\"Base variant: Standard Infotainment, Manual AC, Dual Airbags, Central Locking\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To choose the right variant, consider your needs: the Base variant offers standard features like manual AC, dual airbags, and central locking; the X variant adds an 11-inch touchscreen, ADAS Level 1 features, automatic climate control, and alloy wheels; and the ZX variant provides advanced technology with a Harman sound system, 360\\u00b0 camera, ADAS Level 2, leather seats, and premium LED lighting.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What do you think about the Aventro Spark's design and features?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Class-leading safety and infotainment\\\",\\n        \\\"Multiple powertrains to suit every need\\\",\\n        \\\"Lowest cost of ownership in its segment\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Spark offers class-leading safety and infotainment, multiple powertrain options to suit various needs, and is recognized for having the lowest cost of ownership in its segment.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm trying to view the specifications of my Aventro Spark on your website but the page won't load properly and keeps showing error messages.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Contact: +91 124 1234567\\\",\\n        \\\"Email: info@aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If you're experiencing issues with loading the specifications page, please contact customer support at +91 124 1234567 or via email at info@aventromotors.com for assistance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Aventr Spark specs not hlping.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engine Options: Petrol \\/ Diesel \\/ Electric \\/ Hybrid\\\",\\n        \\\"Fuel Tank Capacity: 40 Litres (IC engine variants)\\\",\\n        \\\"Boot Space: 280 Litres\\\",\\n        \\\"Seating: 5\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Spark hatchback offers engine options of Petrol, Diesel, Electric, and Hybrid, a fuel tank capacity of 40 Litres for IC engine variants, 280 Litres of boot space, and seating for 5.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does the Aventro Spark compare to other hatchbacks in terms of safety and cost of ownership?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Class-leading safety and infotainment\\\",\\n        \\\"Lowest cost of ownership in its segment\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Spark provides class-leading safety and infotainment features and is known for having the lowest cost of ownership in its segment.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I tried navigating your site today and found it quite confusing.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will investigate and work to improve our website\\u2019s performance.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"18\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you explain how I should adjust the steering wheel in my Aventro Motors vehicle for better comfort and safety?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Proper steering wheel adjustment is essential for comfortable and safe driving. Follow these steps to adjust your steering wheel for an optimal driving position.\\\",\\n        \\\"Most Aventro Motors vehicles come with either or both of the following: - Tilt Adjustment: Allows the wheel to move up and down. - Telescopic Adjustment: Allows the wheel to move closer or farther from the driver.\\\",\\n        \\\"1. Park the Vehicle Safely - Ensure the vehicle is on a flat surface and engage the parking brake. - Turn off the engine for safety.\\\",\\n        \\\"2. Locate the Adjustment Lever - Look for the steering adjustment lever beneath or on the side of the steering column, usually beneath the wheel.\\\",\\n        \\\"3. Release the Lever - Pull (or push, depending on the model) the adjustment lever to unlock the steering wheel movement.\\\",\\n        \\\"4. Adjust the Steering Wheel - Tilt: Move the wheel up or down to a comfortable height. - Telescopic: Pull the wheel towards you or push it away to set a comfortable distance. - The steering wheel should not obstruct your view of the gauges.\\\",\\n        \\\"5. Lock the Steering Wheel Position - Once set, firmly push the adjustment lever back to the locked position.\\\",\\n        \\\"6. Check Positioning - With your back against the seat, extend your arms and rest your wrists on top of the wheel; your elbows should be slightly bent. - Ensure there is at least 25 cm (10 inches) between your chest and the wheel (important for airbag safety). - Confirm that all indicator lights and gauges are fully visible.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To adjust your steering wheel, first ensure your vehicle is parked safely with the engine turned off. Locate and release the adjustment lever, then adjust the wheel using either the tilt adjustment to change the height or the telescopic adjustment to change the distance. Finally, lock the lever back in place and check that your positioning is correct with all gauges visible.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What types of steering wheel adjustments are available in Aventro Motors vehicles, and how should I handle it if the adjustment lever gets stuck?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Most Aventro Motors vehicles come with either or both of the following: - Tilt Adjustment: Allows the wheel to move up and down. - Telescopic Adjustment: Allows the wheel to move closer or farther from the driver.\\\",\\n        \\\"Troubleshooting - Stuck Lever: Check for obstructions under\\/around the lever or consult your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors vehicles offer tilt adjustment, which allows the wheel to move up and down, and telescopic adjustment, which brings the wheel closer or farther from the driver. If the adjustment lever gets stuck, you should check for obstructions under or around the lever or consult your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide me with step-by-step guidance on how to adjust the steering wheel in my Aventro vehicle?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"1. Park the Vehicle Safely - Ensure the vehicle is on a flat surface and engage the parking brake. - Turn off the engine for safety.\\\",\\n        \\\"2. Locate the Adjustment Lever - Look for the steering adjustment lever beneath or on the side of the steering column, usually beneath the wheel.\\\",\\n        \\\"3. Release the Lever - Pull (or push, depending on the model) the adjustment lever to unlock the steering wheel movement.\\\",\\n        \\\"4. Adjust the Steering Wheel - Tilt: Move the wheel up or down to a comfortable height. - Telescopic: Pull the wheel towards you or push it away to set a comfortable distance. - The steering wheel should not obstruct your view of the gauges.\\\",\\n        \\\"5. Lock the Steering Wheel Position - Once set, firmly push the adjustment lever back to the locked position.\\\",\\n        \\\"6. Check Positioning - With your back against the seat, extend your arms and rest your wrists on top of the wheel; your elbows should be slightly bent. - Ensure there is at least 25 cm (10 inches) between your chest and the wheel (important for airbag safety). - Confirm that all indicator lights and gauges are fully visible.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To adjust your steering wheel, start by parking the vehicle safely with the parking brake engaged and the engine turned off. Next, locate the adjustment lever beneath or on the side of the steering column, release it by pulling or pushing, and then adjust the wheel\\u2019s tilt and\\/or telescopic position. Once a comfortable position is found, lock the lever back in place and check that your positioning meets the safety guidelines provided.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your opinion, does adjusting the steering wheel really enhance the comfort and safety of driving?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Why Adjust the Steering Wheel? - Comfort: Reduces fatigue during long drives.\\\",\\n        \\\"Why Adjust the Steering Wheel? - Control: Ensures effective steering and better handling.\\\",\\n        \\\"Why Adjust the Steering Wheel? - Safety: Ensures clear view of the instrument cluster and optimal airbag positioning.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Adjusting the steering wheel enhances comfort by reducing fatigue, improves control by ensuring effective steering, and increases safety by providing a clear view of the instrument cluster and optimal airbag positioning.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"After adjusting my steering wheel, I've noticed that it feels loose. What might be causing this issue?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Loose Wheel: Ensure the lever is locked; if the wheel remains loose, have it inspected by a professional.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If your steering wheel feels loose after adjustment, make sure the adjustment lever is firmly locked. If the issue persists, have it inspected by a professional.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"stng wheel ajustmnt actin weird, lever seems stuck - any recs?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Troubleshooting - Stuck Lever: Check for obstructions under\\/around the lever or consult your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If your steering wheel adjustment lever appears to be stuck, you should check for obstructions under or around the lever or consult your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I've seen competitors offer advanced steering wheel adjustm