slightly and pull or rotate the control to release the backrest, adjust so you are sitting upright with your shoulders touching the seatback at a slightly reclined angle not more than 30\\u00b0 from upright, and ensure it is firmly locked in position before driving.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide step-by-step instructions on how to adjust my headrest?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Hold both sides of the headrest.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press the adjustment button (usually at the base) and move the headrest up or down.\\\",\\n        \\\"The top of the headrest should be level with the top of your head.\\\",\\n        \\\"The headrest should be as close to the back of your head as possible for optimal safety.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Step 1: Hold both sides of the headrest. Step 2: Press the adjustment button (usually at the base) and move the headrest up or down. Step 3: Adjust until the top of the headrest is level with the top of your head and is positioned as close to the back of your head as possible for optimal safety.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Which seat adjustment feature do you think makes Aventro Motors vehicles the safest for long drives?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Proper seat adjustment is essential for driving comfort, safety, and visibility.\\\",\\n        \\\"The headrest should be as close to the back of your head as possible for optimal safety.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The guide emphasizes that proper seat adjustment is essential for driving comfort, safety, and visibility, and specifically notes that the headrest should be as close to the back of your head as possible for optimal safety, which can be considered a key feature for long drives.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I tried to adjust my seat, but the electronic controls do not work. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Electronic controls not working: Check vehicle battery or fuses.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If the electronic controls are not working, check the vehicle battery or fuses.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"my seat ain't movin, help plz!\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Seat not moving: Check for obstructions under the seat.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If your seat is not moving, check for obstructions under the seat.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does Aventro Motors' seat adjustment process compare to other brands? Why should I choose Aventro?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Motors vehicles are equipped with manual and\\/or electronic seat adjustment controls, depending on the model and trim.\\\",\\n        \\\"Proper seat adjustment is essential for driving comfort, safety, and visibility.\\\",\\n        \\\"The headrest should be as close to the back of your head as possible for optimal safety.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors offers manual and\\/or electronic seat adjustment controls, ensuring that proper seat adjustment is achieved for driving comfort, safety, and visibility, with features like headrest adjustment for optimal safety, making its process thorough and reliable.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"My experience with the seat adjustment guide was confusing and I felt the instructions weren't clear.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will look into your concerns and work on fixing the issues.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"21\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How do I open the hood of my Aventro vehicle safely?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Opening the hood of your Aventro car is a simple process that gives you access to the engine compartment for checks and maintenance.\\\",\\n        \\\"Ensure your car is parked on a level surface.\\\",\\n        \\\"Turn off the engine and engage the parking brake.\\\",\\n        \\\"The hood release lever is usually located under the dashboard, to the right or left of the driver\\u2019s seat (near the footwell).\\\",\\n        \\\"Pull the lever firmly. You should hear a slight click as the hood pops up a little.\\\",\\n        \\\"Slide your hand under the center front edge of the hood. Feel for the secondary latch (usually a small lever or tab). Push or slide the latch to one side to release the hood completely.\\\",\\n        \\\"Lift the hood open.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To open the hood of your Aventro vehicle, first ensure the car is parked on a level surface, the engine is turned off, and the parking brake is engaged. Then locate the hood release lever under the dashboard near the driver\\u2019s seat, pull it firmly until you hear a click, move to the front to find and release the secondary latch by pushing or sliding it, and finally lift the hood open.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you explain the steps to open and close the Aventro hood, and what safety tips should I follow?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Opening the hood of your Aventro car is a simple process that gives you access to the engine compartment for checks and maintenance.\\\",\\n        \\\"Ensure your car is parked on a level surface.\\\",\\n        \\\"Turn off the engine and engage the parking brake.\\\",\\n        \\\"The hood release lever is usually located under the dashboard, to the right or left of the driver\\u2019s seat (near the footwell).\\\",\\n        \\\"Pull the lever firmly. You should hear a slight click as the hood pops up a little.\\\",\\n        \\\"Slide your hand under the center front edge of the hood. Feel for the secondary latch (usually a small lever or tab). Push or slide the latch to one side to release the hood completely.\\\",\\n        \\\"Lift the hood open.\\\",\\n        \\\"Remove the Prop Rod (if applicable) and place it back into its holder.\\\",\\n        \\\"Lower the hood gently to about 30 cm (1 foot) above the latch, then allow it to drop shut.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check it is Securely Latched by pressing gently on the front edge\\u2014do not slam.\\\",\\n        \\\"Never open the hood while the car is moving.\\\",\\n        \\\"Allow engine components to cool before touching.\\\",\\n        \\\"Always ensure the hood is closed securely before driving.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To open the Aventro hood, park on a level surface, turn off the engine, engage the parking brake, locate and pull the hood release lever under the dashboard until you hear a click, then go to the front to release the secondary latch and lift the hood. To close it, remove the prop rod if used, lower the hood gently to about 30 cm above the latch, and ensure it is securely latched. Always follow safety tips such as not opening the hood while the car is moving, allowing engine components to cool, and ensuring the hood is properly closed before driving.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide a step-by-step guide on how to open the hood on my Aventro car?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Ensure your car is parked on a level surface.\\\",\\n        \\\"Turn off the engine and engage the parking brake.\\\",\\n        \\\"The hood release lever is usually located under the dashboard, to the right or left of the driver\\u2019s seat (near the footwell).\\\",\\n        \\\"Pull the lever firmly. You should hear a slight click as the hood pops up a little.\\\",\\n        \\\"Move to the front of the car. The hood will now be slightly raised.\\\",\\n        \\\"Slide your hand under the center front edge of the hood. Feel for the secondary latch (usually a small lever or tab). Push or slide the latch to one side to release the hood completely.\\\",\\n        \\\"Lift the hood open.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Step 1: Park your car on a level surface, turn off the engine, and engage the parking brake. Step 2: Locate the hood release lever under the dashboard near the driver\\u2019s seat. Step 3: Pull the lever firmly until you hear a slight click. Step 4: Move to the front of the car where the hood is slightly raised. Step 5: Slide your hand under the center front edge of the hood, locate the secondary latch, and push or slide it to fully release the hood. Step 6: Lift the hood open.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your opinion, is the process for opening the Aventro hood designed to be user-friendly?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Opening the hood of your Aventro car is a simple process that gives you access to the engine compartment for checks and maintenance.\\\",\\n        \\\"The hood release lever is usually located under the dashboard, to the right or left of the driver\\u2019s seat (near the footwell).\\\",\\n        \\\"Pull the lever firmly. You should hear a slight click as the hood pops up a little.\\\",\\n        \\\"Slide your hand under the center front edge of the hood. Feel for the secondary latch (usually a small lever or tab). Push or slide the latch to one side to release the hood completely.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Based on the document, the Aventro hood process is designed to be user-friendly, featuring a clearly located hood release lever and a straightforward sequence of steps for safely accessing the engine compartment.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm trying to open my Aventro hood but when I pull the lever, I don't hear the click or see the hood pop up. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Pull the lever firmly. You should hear a slight click as the hood pops up a little.\\\",\\n        \\\"For any difficulties or if the hood does not open as expected, refer to your Aventro Owner\\u2019s Manual or visit your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If you don't hear a click or see the hood pop up when you pull the lever, please refer to your Aventro Owner\\u2019s Manual or visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for assistance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"my hood ain't openin', no click heard when i pulled the lever. help plz?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Pull the lever firmly. You should hear a slight click as the hood pops up a little.\\\",\\n        \\\"For any difficulties or if the hood does not open as expected, refer to your Aventro Owner\\u2019s Manual or visit your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"When you pull the lever firmly, you should hear a slight click as the hood pops up. If this does not happen, refer to your Aventro Owner\\u2019s Manual or visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for further assistance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does the process for opening the Aventro hood compare in simplicity to that of other car manufacturers?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Op