 for voltage and current.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can I install a high-powered audio system myself, and will it affect my Aventro warranty?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Before installation, consult your nearest Aventro Service Center or authorized dealer for advice.\\\",\\n        \\\"Ask specifically about warranty impact: certified installations at Aventro Service Centers are less likely to void your warranty.\\\",\\n        \\\"Never attempt to install complex electrical or electronic components yourself unless you\\u2019re certified.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"You should consult your nearest Aventro Service Center or authorized dealer for advice, as certified installations are less likely to void your warranty, and you should never attempt to install complex electrical or electronic components yourself unless you\\u2019re certified.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you guide me step-by-step on how to safely install a third-party infotainment system in my Aventro?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Before installation, consult your nearest Aventro Service Center or authorized dealer for advice.\\\",\\n        \\\"Have all accessories, particularly electrical or electronic ones, fitted by trained technicians.\\\",\\n        \\\"Use proper connectors, fuses, and avoid splicing into factory wiring harnesses.\\\",\\n        \\\"Keep invoices, product manuals, and warranties safe.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"First, consult your nearest Aventro Service Center or authorized dealer for advice. Then, have the accessory fitted by trained technicians using proper connectors and fuses while avoiding splicing into factory wiring harnesses, and finally, keep all invoices, product manuals, and warranties safe.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are your recommendations for third-party accessory installations on my Aventro?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Always check the compatibility of the accessory with your specific Aventro model and variant.\\\",\\n        \\\"Buy from reputed dealers.\\\",\\n        \\\"Consult your nearest Aventro Service Center for advice.\\\",\\n        \\\"Have all accessories, particularly electrical or electronic ones, fitted by trained technicians.\\\",\\n        \\\"Only use accessories compliant with BIS (Bureau of Indian Standards) and other safety norms.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"It is recommended that you always check the compatibility of the accessory with your specific Aventro model, buy from reputed dealers, consult your nearest Aventro Service Center for advice, have fittings done by trained technicians, and use accessories that are compliant with BIS and other safety norms.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"After installing a new aftermarket audio system, I receive dashboard warnings. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"If you notice dashboard warnings, flickering lights, or malfunctioning electronics post-installation, stop using the accessory immediately and consult a service center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If you notice dashboard warnings, flickering lights, or malfunctioning electronics, you should stop using the accessory immediately and consult a service center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Im srry, but i tink the part isnt fixin right 4 my car. Pls hlp ASAP.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"If you notice dashboard warnings, flickering lights, or malfunctioning electronics post-installation, stop using the accessory immediately and consult a service center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If you notice any dashboard warnings, flickering lights, or malfunctioning electronics, stop using the accessory immediately and consult a service center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does Aventro suggest handling third-party electrical accessories compared to other brands?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Always check the compatibility of the accessory with your specific Aventro model and variant.\\\",\\n        \\\"Buy from reputed dealers.\\\",\\n        \\\"Before installation, consult your nearest Aventro Service Center or authorized dealer for advice.\\\",\\n        \\\"Ask specifically about warranty impact: certified installations at Aventro Service Centers are less likely to void your warranty.\\\",\\n        \\\"Have all accessories, particularly electrical or electronic ones, fitted by trained technicians.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro advises that you always check the compatibility of the accessory with your specific model, buy from reputed dealers, consult your nearest Aventro Service Center or authorized dealer, consider the warranty impact with certified installations, and have all accessories fitted by trained technicians.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I think the safety guidelines on your website could be more detailed.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate your input and will consider it for future improvements.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"26\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I need assistance to book an appointment at Aventro Service Center, Chennai. Could you provide the necessary contact details and addre