parture Warning and Forward Collision Alert.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide a step-by-step guide on how to book a test drive for the Aventro Aero?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"To Book a Test Drive or for Any Queries\\\",\\n        \\\"Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd., Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018, India\\\",\\n        \\\"Phone: +91 124 1234567\\\",\\n        \\\"Email: info@aventromotors.com\\\",\\n        \\\"Website: www.aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To book a test drive, first note the contact details provided: reach out to Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd. at Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018. Then call +91 124 1234567, email info@aventromotors.com, or visit www.aventromotors.com for further assistance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm considering purchasing the Aventro Aero. What do you think about its design and performance features?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"- Futuristic Design and Spacious Interior\\\",\\n        \\\"Segment-leading Tech: ADAS, 360 Camera, 11\\\\\\\" Infotainment\\\",\\n        \\\"Industry-best Safety Standards\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Aero offers a futuristic design with a spacious interior, segment-leading technology including ADAS, a 360 Camera and an 11\\\\\\\" Infotainment System, as well as industry-best safety standards.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm experiencing an issue where the infotainment touchscreen\",\"28\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you explain what traction control is and how it works in my vehicle?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Traction Control is a vehicle safety feature designed to prevent the loss of traction (grip) of the driven road wheels, which can occur during acceleration.\\\",\\n        \\\"By detecting when one or more wheels are slipping, the system automatically applies the brakes or reduces engine power to maintain optimal grip, especially on slippery surfaces.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Traction Control is a vehicle safety feature designed to prevent the loss of traction (grip) of the driven road wheels during acceleration by automatically applying the brakes or reducing engine power when wheels slip.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you detail both how traction control works and what its key components are?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Traction control systems are usually integrated with a car's anti-lock braking system (ABS) and electronic stability control (ESC).\\\",\\n        \\\"Sensors detect when a wheel is spinning faster than others (indicating loss of traction).\\\",\\n        \\\"The Electronic Control Unit (ECU) receives data from sensors and determines the appropriate intervention.\\\",\\n        \\\"Intervention: - Braking: The system applies brakes to the slipping wheel(s). - Engine Control: The ECU may reduce engine power or throttle input to minimize wheel spin.\\\",\\n        \\\"Key Components: - Wheel Speed Sensors, - ECU (Electronic Control Unit), - Braking Mechanism, - Throttle Control (in advanced systems).\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Traction control works by integrating with the car's ABS and ESC; sensors detect a wheel spinning faster than the others, and the ECU intervenes by applying brakes or reducing engine power. Its key components include Wheel Speed Sensors, an ECU, a Braking Mechanism, and Throttle Control in advanced systems.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you guide me through the process of what happens internally when traction control is active, and what steps I should follow if I suspect a problem with it?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Sensors detect when a wheel is spinning faster than others (indicating loss of traction).\\\",\\n        \\\"The Electronic Control Unit (ECU) receives data from sensors and determines the appropriate intervention.\\\",\\n        \\\"Intervention: - Braking: The system applies brakes to the slipping wheel(s). - Engine Control: The ECU may reduce engine power or throttle input to minimize wheel spin.\\\",\\n        \\\"If you experience issues with traction control (warning lights, loss of system function), contact your nearest Aventro Service Center for diagnostics and repair.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"When traction control is active, sensors first detect a wheel spinning faster than others; the ECU processes this information and intervenes by applying brakes or reducing engine power. If you suspect an issue, such as warning lights or loss of function, you should contact your nearest Aventro Service Center for diagnostics and repair.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your view, how beneficial is traction control for driving safety, especially in hazardous conditions?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Improved Safety: Helps maintain control during acceleration on wet, icy, or loose surfaces.\\\",\\n        \\\"Reduced Wheel Spin: Minimizes tire wear and prevents excessive wheel spin.\\\",\\n        \\\"Enhanced Stability: Works in tandem with ABS and ESC for overall vehicle stability.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Traction control is highly beneficial as it improves safety by maintaining control on slippery surfaces, reduces wheel spin to minimize tire wear, and enhances overall vehicle stability when paired with ABS and ESC.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"My traction control indicator light is constantly on; what does this mean?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Constant illumination may indicate a fault in the traction control system; service is recommended at an authorized Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If the traction control indicator light is constantly on, it may indicate a fault in the system, and you should have it serviced at an authorized Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Traction ctl not workin properly, what should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"If you experience issues with traction control (warning lights, loss of system function), contact your nearest Aventro Service Center for diagnostics and repair.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If traction control is not working properly, such as showing warning lights or loss of function, you should contact your nearest Aventro Service Center for diagnostics and repair.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does the traction control system in Aventro Motors' ZX trim compare to what's offered by competitors?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Most modern vehicles, including Aventro Motors models across Hatchback, Sedan, and SUV variants, are equipped with traction control as standard or optional, especially in ZX or higher trim levels.\\\",\\n        \\\"This is part of Aventro's commitment to vehicle safety and performance under varied driving conditions.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors equips its vehicles with traction control as standard or optional across Hatchback, Sedan, and SUV variants, especially in ZX or higher trim levels, reflecting its commitment to vehicle safety and performance under varied driving conditions.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I found the information on your traction control feature a bit confusing.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate your input and will work to improve our communications.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"29\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide detailed information on Aventro Motors' product lineup?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd. is one of India's rapidly growing automobile manufacturers, renowned for its innovation in both conventional and alternative powertrain technologies.\\\",\\n        \\\"The company offers a comprehensive lineup of passenger cars that includes petrol, diesel, electric, and hybrid variants.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors is a rapidly growing manufacturer that offers a comprehensive lineup of passenger cars including petrol, diesel, electric, and hybrid variants.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are some major milestones in Aventro Motors' history and how many employees do you currently have?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"By 2023, it had opened over 20 service centers across major Indian cities, diversified its product portfolio to 20 models, and launched digital initiatives for customer engagement and after-sales service.\\\",\\n        \\\"As of March 2024, Aventro Motors employs over 2,000 people across India.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors has marked major milestones such as opening over 20 service centers by 2023 and currently employs over 2,000 people.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you guide me step-by-step on how to contact Aventro Motors for more information or support?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For more information, visit [aventromotors.com](mailto:info@aventromotors.com) or call +91 124 1234567.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To contact Aventro Motors, first visit their website at aventromotors.com, and if needed, call +91 124 1234567 for further assistance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is your opinion on Aventro Motors' innovative approach, especially regarding their eco-friendly vehicle initiatives?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd. is one of India's rapidly growing automobile manufacturers, renowned for its innovation in both conventional and alternative powertrain technologies.\\\",\\n        \\\"Introduced electric and hybrid models in 2017, making it one of the first Indian carmakers to transition towards eco-friendly mobility solutions.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors is highly innovative, particularly with its early transition to electric and hybrid models in 2017, reflecting a strong commitment to eco-friendly mobility solutions.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm having an issue accessing detailed information about your product lineup on your website. Can you help me resolve this error?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"The company offers a comprehensive lineup of passenger cars that includes petrol, diesel, electric, and hybrid variants.\\\",\\n        \\\"For more information, visit [aventromotors.com](mailto:info@aventromotors.com) or call +91 124 1234567.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors offers a comprehensive lineup of passenger cars including petrol, diesel, electric, and hybrid variants. For further assistance or to resolve access issues, please visit aventromotors.com or call +91 124 1234567.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Hey Aventro, whr iz ur support num? Need to get in touch asap!\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For more information, visit [aventromotors.com](mailto:info@aventromotors.com) or call +91 124 1234567.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"You can get in touch with Aventro Motors by visiting aventromotors.com or by calling +91 124 1234567.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does Aventro Motors' approach to innovation and eco-friendly vehicles set it apart from its competitors?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd. is one of India's rapidly growing automobile manufacturers, renowned for its innovation in both conventional and alternative powertrain technologies.\\\",\\n        \\\"Introduced electric and hybrid models in 2017, making it one of the first Indian carmakers to transition towards eco-friendly mobility solutions.\\\",\\n        \\\"The launch of the Aventro Spark Electric in 2019 was a significant milestone, receiving positive market response and industry awards.\\\",\\n        \\\"The company offers a comprehensive lineup of passenger cars that includes petrol, diesel, electric, and hybrid variants.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors distinguishes itself through its pioneering innovation in both conventional and alternative powertrain technologies, its early adoption of electric and hybrid models in 2017, and the successful launch of the Aventro Spark Electric in 2019, along with a comprehensive lineup of vehicles.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I find the website interface a bit confusing and hard to navigate.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate you sharing your thoughts.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"30\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide details on the Aventro Glory SUV variants along with their prices and notable features?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"| **Glory Petrol**   | Petrol    | Base | 13.5         | Basic infotainment, standard safety features                          |\\\",\\n        \\\"|                |           | X    | 14.0         | **11-inch Infotainment, ADAS Level 1**                               |\\\",\\n        \\\"|                |           | ZX   | 14.5         | **360 Camera, 11-inch Infotainment with Harman System, ADAS Level 2, Leather Seats** |\\\",\\n        \\\"| **Glory Diesel**   | Diesel    | Base | 19.0         | Basic infotainment, standard safety features                          |\\\",\\n        \\\"|                |           | X    | 19.5         | **11-inch Infotainment, ADAS Level 1**                               |\\\",\\n        \\\"|                |           | ZX   | 20.0         | **360 Camera, 11-inch Infotainment with Harman System, ADAS Level 2, Leather Seats** |\\\",\\n        \\\"| **Glory Electric** | Electric  | Base | 20.5         | Basic infotainment, standard safety features                          |\\\",\\n        \\\"|                |           | X    | 21.0         | **11-inch Infotainment, ADAS Level 1**                               |\\\",\\n        \\\"|                |           | ZX   | 21.5         | **360 Camera, 11-inch Infotainment with Harman System, ADAS Level 2, Leather Seats** |\\\",\\n        \\\"| **Glory Hybrid**   | Hybrid    | Base | \",\"31\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you explain what ABS is and its main purpose in vehicles?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"ABS stands for Anti-lock Braking System.\\\",\\n        \\\"It is a vital safety feature in modern vehicles, designed to prevent the wheels from locking up during emergency braking situations.\\\",\\n        \\\"By maintaining tractive contact with the road surface, ABS enhances vehicle control and reduces stopping distances on both wet and dry surfaces.\\\",\\n        \\\"Prevents wheel lock-up during sudden or hard braking.\\\",\\n        \\\"Maintains steering control, allowing the driver to maneuver the vehicle while braking.\\\",\\n        \\\"Reduces the risk of skidding or uncontrolled vehicle movement.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"ABS stands for Anti-lock Braking System. It is a vital safety feature in modern vehicles designed to prevent the wheels from locking up during emergency braking by maintaining tractive contact with the road, enhancing control, and reducing stopping distances while also preventing wheel lock-up, maintaining steering control, and reducing the risk of skidding.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does ABS work and what advantages does it offer?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"ABS operates using a combination of sensors, valves, and electronic control units.\\\",\\n        \\\"ABS uses sensors located at each wheel to monitor the rotational speed of the wheels continuously.\\\",\\n        \\\"When it detects a wheel about to lock, it controls the hydraulic brake pressure through a modulator.\\\",\\n        \\\"These valves rapidly increase or decrease brake pressure to each wheel as needed.\\\",\\n        \\\"By releasing and then reapplying the brakes repeatedly in quick succession, ABS prevents the wheels from locking up.\\\",\\n        \\\"Improved Steering Control: Allows the driver to steer around obstacles while braking hard.\\\",\\n        \\\"Shorter Stopping Distance: Especially on slippery or wet roads, ABS can reduce stopping distances.\\\",\\n        \\\"Reduced Tire Wear: Prevents flat-spotting of tires due to skidding.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"ABS works by using sensors at each wheel to monitor rotational speed, and when a potential lock-up is detected, the electronic control unit adjusts hydraulic brake pressure via valves that rapidly increase or decrease the pressure. Its advantages include improved steering control, shorter stopping distances on slippery roads, and reduced tire wear.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide step-by-step guidance on what to do if the ABS activates during an emergency braking situation?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"During hard braking, you may feel a pulsating sensation in the brake pedal.\\\",\\n        \\\"This is normal and indicates that the ABS is actively working.\\\",\\n        \\\"Do not pump the brakes; instead, apply firm, continuous pressure.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"When ABS activates during emergency braking, you will feel a pulsating sensation in the brake pedal, which is normal. Do not pump the brakes; instead, apply firm, continuous pressure.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is your opinion on the use of ABS in vehicles?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"ABS stands for Anti-lock Braking System. It is a vital safety feature in modern vehicles, designed to prevent the wheels from locking up during emergency braking situations.\\\",\\n        \\\"ABS is a critical automotive safety technology that saves lives by helping drivers maintain control of their vehicles in emergency situations.\\\",\\n        \\\"Improved Steering Control: Allows the driver to steer around obstacles while braking hard.\\\",\\n        \\\"Shorter Stopping Distance: Especially on slippery or wet roads, ABS can reduce stopping distances.\\\",\\n        \\\"Reduced Tire Wear: Prevents flat-spotting of tires due to skidding.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"ABS is a vital and critical safety technology in vehicles as it prevents the wheels from locking up during emergencies by enhancing steering control, reducing stopping distances, and minimizing tire wear, all of which contribute to safer driving.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I noticed a pulsating sensation in my brake pedal when braking hard. Is this a malfunction in the ABS?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"During hard braking, you may feel a pulsating sensation in the brake pedal.\\\",\\n        \\\"This is normal and indicates that the ABS is actively working.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The pulsating sensation in your brake pedal during hard braking is normal and indicates that the ABS is actively working.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"abs ain't workin right; my brake pedal is pulsatin' weird. Should I be pumpin' the brakes?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"During hard braking, you may feel a pulsating sensation in the brake pedal.\\\",\\n        \\\"This is normal and indicates that the ABS is actively working.\\\",\\n        \\\"Do not pump the brakes; instead, apply firm, continuous pressure.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If you feel a pulsating sensation in the brake pedal, it indicates that the ABS is working normally. Do not pump the brakes; instead, apply firm, continuous pressure.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I heard a competitor offers a different braking system. How does your ABS compare in terms of safety and control?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"ABS stands for Anti-lock Braking System.\\\",\\n        \\\"It is a vital safety feature in modern vehicles, designed to prevent the wheels from locking up during emergency braking situations.\\\",\\n        \\\"Prevents wheel lock-up during sudden or hard braking.\\\",\\n        \\\"Maintains steering control, allowing the driver to maneuver the vehicle while braking.\\\",\\n        \\\"Reduces the risk of skidding or uncontrolled vehicle movement.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Our ABS is a vital safety feature that prevents wheel lock-up during emergency braking, maintains steering control,\",\"32\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you tell me what is the seating capacity and boot space of the Aventro Prime sedan?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Seating Capacity: 5\\\",\\n        \\\"Boot Space: 450 L\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Prime has a seating capacity of 5 and a boot space of 450 L.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What powertrain options are available for the Aventro Prime, and does it come with auto climate control in all variants?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"The Prime is available in four efficient powertrains: Petrol, Diesel, Electric, and Hybrid.\\\",\\n        \\\"Auto Climate Control             | \\u2714\\ufe0f               | \\u2714\\ufe0f                           | \\u2714\\ufe0f\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Prime is available with Petrol, Diesel, Electric, and Hybrid powertrains and all variants include auto climate control.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How do I book a test drive for the Aventro Prime sedan?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"To Book a Test Drive or for More Details:\\\\n\\\\nContact: +91 124 1234567\\\\nEmail: info@aventromotors.com\\\\nWebsite: www.aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To book a test drive, please contact +91 124 1234567 or email info@aventromotors.com, and visit www.aventromotors.com for more details.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm interested in the Aventro Prime ZX variant. What key features does it offer?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"ZX Trim (In addition to X)\\\\n- 360\\u00b0 Surround View Camera\\\\n- 11-inch Harman-Kardon Infotainment with Enhanced Audio\\\\n- ADAS Level 2 Safety Suite\\\\n- Luxurious Leather Seats\\\\n- Powered Driver\\u2019s Seat\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Prime ZX variant offers a 360\\u00b0 Surround View Camera, 11-inch Harman-Kardon Infotainment with Enhanced Audio, ADAS Level 2 Safety Suite, luxurious leather seats, and a powered driver\\u2019s seat.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I encountered an error when trying to book a test drive online. Can someone assist me with this issue?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"To Book a Test Drive or for More Details:\\\\n\\\\nContact: +91 124 1234567\\\\nEmail: info@aventromotors.com\\\\nWebsite: www.aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For assistance with booking a test drive, please contact +91 124 1234567 or email info@aventromotors.com, and visit www.aventromotors.com.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Aventro prim sedn specs? Boot spc & seat cap?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Seating Capacity: 5\\\",\\n        \\\"Boot Space: 450 L\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Prime sedan has a seating capacity of 5 and a boot space of 450 L.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does the infotainment system in the Aventro Prime compare in size across its trims?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Touch Infotainment System        | 7-inch           | 11-inch                      | 11-inch (Harman-Kardon)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Prime offers a 7-inch Touch Infotainment System in the Base variant, an 11-inch system in the X trim, and an 11-inch Harman-Kardon system in the ZX trim.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"The service at your showroom was very disappointing, and the booking process took too long.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will investigate and work to improve our service.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"33\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are the recommended temperature settings for using the Aventro Motors car AC during summer, and why should I avoid the lowest setting?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Avoid setting the thermostat to the lowest setting. 22-24\\u00b0C (72-75\\u00b0F) is usually comfortable and easier on the compressor.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"It is recommended to set the temperature between 22-24\\u00b0C (72-75\\u00b0F) because this setting is comfortable and puts less strain on the compressor.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I have two questions: First, how should I use my car AC during the monsoon to prevent fog, and second, how often should I run the AC in winter to prevent mold?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Turn on the AC with the blower directed at the windshield to quickly clear fog.\\\",\\n        \\\"Use the \\u201cfresh air\\u201d mode for a few minutes to reduce internal humidity.\\\",\\n        \\\"Turn on the AC for at least 10 minutes once a week, even in winter. This keeps seals lubricated and prevents mold in the system.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"During the monsoon, you should turn on the AC with the blower directed at the windshield and use the \\\\\\\"fresh air\\\\\\\" mode for a few minutes to reduce humidity and clear fog. In winter, running the AC for at least 10 minutes once a week helps keep the seals lubricated and prevents mold.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide a step-by-step guide on how to use the recirculation mode during a hot summer drive for optimal AC performance?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Before switching on the AC, roll down the windows and drive for a couple of minutes to expel hot air.\\\",\\n        \\\"Turn on the AC and set it to \\u201crecirculate\\u201d once the cabin is cool. This prevents hot outside air from entering, making the system more effective.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"First, roll down the windows and drive for a couple of minutes to expel the hot air. Then, once the cabin cools down, turn on the AC and set it to \\\\\\\"recirculate\\\\\\\" mode to prevent hot air from entering and enhance performance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your opinion, is it more effective to park in the shade or to use the recirculation mode on the AC to minimize the system's workload?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Turn on the AC and set it to \\u201crecirculate\\u201d once the cabin is cool. This prevents hot outside air from entering, making the system more effective.\\\",\\n        \\\"Park in Shade: Protect your car from direct sun to reduce AC workload.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The guide suggests that using recirculation mode helps keep the cabin cool by preventing hot outside air from entering, while parking in the shade reduces the AC's workload by avoiding direct sun exposure. Both methods contribute to better efficiency.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm hearing unusual noises and smelling something foul from my car's AC vents. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Unusual noises\\/smells from the vents\\\",\\n        \\\"Foul smells may indicate mold \\u2013 get the filters and system checked.\\\",\\n        \\\"Visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for expert AC service and diagnostics.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If your AC is making unusual noises and emitting foul odors, it may be an indication of mold or other issues. You should have the filters and system checked and visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for expert diagnostic service.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"AC not workin properly, wht do I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"AC not cooling\\/heating as expected\\\",\\n        \\\"Unusual noises\\/smells from the vents\\\",\\n        \\\"Visible leaks under your car\\\",\\n        \\\"Visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for expert AC service and diagnostics.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If the AC is not working properly, showing signs like not cooling or heating as expected, unusual noises or smells, or visible leaks, please visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for expert service and diagnostics.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does Aventro Motors' AC maintenance service, like regular inspections and refrigerant topping up, compare to what I might find at other service providers?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Clean or replace the cabin air filter.\\\",\\n        \\\"Get your AC system inspected and refrigerant topped up at an Aventro Service Center before summer starts.\\\",\\n        \\\"Schedule professional AC checks at Aventro Service Centers.\\\",\\n        \\\"Visit your nearest Aventro Service Center for expert AC service and diagnostics.\\\",\\n        \\\"For more information or to book an AC service, contact Aventro Motors at [info@aventromotors.com].\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors recommends cleaning or replacing the cabin air filter, having your AC system inspected and refrigerant topped up before summer, and scheduling professional AC checks at our service centers. You can also visit your nearest Aventro Service Center or contact us at [info@aventromotors.com] for expert AC service and diagnostics.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I think your AC usage guide could be more detailed.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate your input.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"34\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you detail the specific engine inspection process for Aventro Certified Pre-Owned Cars?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Complete engine assessment (mounts, leaks, coils)\\\",\\n        \\\"Compression and performance check\\\",\\n        \\\"Oil filter and air filter health\\\",\\n        \\\"Starter motor, alternator, radiator, coolant system\\\",\\n        \\\"Transmission system & clutch operation\\\",\\n        \\\"Fuel injector & fuel pump condition\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The engine inspection includes: Complete engine assessment (mounts, leaks, coils), Compression and performance check, Oil filter and air filter health, Starter motor, alternator, radiator, coolant system, Transmission system & clutch operation, and Fuel injector & fuel pump condition.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What does the overall 380+\",\"35\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How can I open the boot manually using the lever inside my Aventro vehicle?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Locate the boot release lever or button inside the vehicle.  - Usually found near the driver\\u2019s seat or on the driver\\u2019s side door panel.\\\",\\n        \\\"Pull the lever or press the button.  - You\\u2019ll hear a click indicating the boot is unlocked.\\\",\\n        \\\"Go to the rear of the vehicle and lift the boot lid upwards to open.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To open your boot manually, locate the boot release lever or button inside the vehicle (usually near the driver\\u2019s seat or on the driver\\u2019s side door panel), pull it until you hear a click, then go to the rear and lift the boot lid upward.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you tell me how to open the boot using the remote key fob, and also explain how to close an electrically assisted boot?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Press and hold the boot release button on your vehicle\\u2019s remote key fob. - The boot will unlock and, on some models, may open slightly for you to lift.\\\",\\n        \\\"Electrically Assisted\\/Tailgate Models (If Equipped) - Press the boot\\u2019s close button (located on the edge of the boot lid). - The lid will automatically close and latch securely.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To open your boot with the remote key fob, press and hold its boot release button until the boot unlocks or opens slightly. For an electrically assisted boot, press the boot\\u2019s close button on its edge to automatically close and latch it.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide me with step-by-step instructions on how to manually open and then close the boot?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Manual Release (Lever\\/Button) - Locate the boot release lever or button inside the vehicle.  - Usually found near the driver\\u2019s seat or on the driver\\u2019s side door panel.\\\",\\n        \\\"Pull the lever or press the button.  - You\\u2019ll hear a click indicating the boot is unlocked.\\\",\\n        \\\"Go to the rear of the vehicle and lift the boot lid upwards to open.\\\",\\n        \\\"Manual Closing - Grip the inner handle or any designated area on the inside of the boot lid.\\\",\\n        \\\"Pull the boot lid down smoothly and press gently until you hear it latch.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"First, manually open the boot by locating the boot release lever or button (found near the driver\\u2019s seat or on the driver\\u2019s side door panel), then pull or press it until you hear a click, and finally lift the boot lid from the rear. To close it, grip the inner handle or designated area, pull the lid down smoothly, and press gently until it latches.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What do you think about the safety features provided in the boot closing instructions?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Cautions When Closing - Make sure there are no obstructions or luggage sticking out.\\\",\\n        \\\"Ensure all hands and fingers are away from the boot area before closing.\\\",\\n        \\\"Do not slam the boot lid; close it with a gentle but firm push.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The boot closing instructions emphasize safety by advising users to check for obstructions, keep hands and fingers clear of the boot area, and close the lid gently rather than slamming it.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I tried using my remote key fob to open the boot, but nothing happened. What should I check?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"If the boot does not open or close properly, check if the vehicle is in \\u2018Valet Mode\\u2019 or if the child safety lock for the boot is engaged.\\\",\\n        \\\"For electrically operated boots, ensure the battery has sufficient charge.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If your boot is not opening, check if the vehicle is in \\u2018Valet Mode\\u2019 or if the child safety lock is engaged, and if your boot is electrically operated, make sure the battery has sufficient charge.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Hey, my boot ain't poppin' open even after I hit the button. Any idea what might be wrong?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"If the boot does not open or close properly, check if the vehicle is in \\u2018Valet Mode\\u2019 or if the child safety lock for the boot is engaged.\\\",\\n        \\\"For electrically operated boots, ensure the battery has sufficient charge.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If your boot isn't opening, ensure that your vehicle is not in \\u2018Valet Mode\\u2019 and that the child safety lock is not engaged, and for electrically operated boots, verify that the battery has enough charge.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does the Aventro boot's hands-free opening option work compared to other brands?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"There are several ways you can open the boot (trunk) of your Aventro vehicle, depending on the model and features equipped:\\\",\\n        \\\"Hands-Free Option (If Equipped) - With the key fob in your possession, stand behind the boot and make a gentle kicking motion under the center of the rear bumper (sensor area). - Wait for a few seconds; the boot will unlatch automatically. Lift to open.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro offers a hands-free boot opening option where, with the key fob in possession, you stand behind the boot and make a gentle kicking motion under the rear bumper\\u2019s sensor area, causing the boot to unlatch automatically. This is one of several methods available in Aventro vehicles.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"The boot closing mechanism feels stiff and the instructions could be clearer.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate your input and will work to improve our service.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"36\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide detailed information on the features of the Aventro Swift Sedan ZX variant, including its infotainment system, ADAS, and engine specifications?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"11-inch + Harman Audio, 360\\u00ba camera, ADAS Level 2, Leather seats (ZX only)\\\",\\n        \\\"11-inch Infotainment with Harman Premium Audio System, 360\\u00ba Camera System, ADAS Level 2 (Adaptive Cruise Control, Traffic Jam Assist, etc.), Premium Leather Seats\\\",\\n        \\\"Petrol: 1.5L SmartTech Engine, 5MT \\/ 6AT, 113 ps, Petrol\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Swift Sedan ZX variant features an 11-inch infotainment system with Harman Premium Audio, a 360\\u00ba camera, ADAS Level 2, and premium leather seats, and it is equipped with a 1.5L SmartTech Engine delivering 113 ps.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you tell me what engine types are available for the Aventro Swift Sedan in its Petrol, Diesel, Electric, and Hybrid variants, and also explain the transmission options for each?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Petrol: 1.5L SmartTech Engine, 5MT \\/ 6AT, 113 ps, Petrol\\\",\\n        \\\"Diesel: 1.5L TurboCRDi Diesel, 6MT, 108 ps, Diesel\\\",\\n        \\\"Electric: 50 kWh Li-ion battery, FWD, Automatic, 136 ps, Electric\\\",\\n        \\\"Hybrid: 1.5L Hybrid Petrol-Electric, CVT, 105 ps, Hybrid\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Swift Sedan offers a 1.5L SmartTech Engine with 5MT or 6AT for Petrol, a 1.5L TurboCRDi Diesel with 6MT for Diesel, a 50 kWh Li-ion battery with Automatic transmission for Electric, and a 1.5L Hybrid Petrol-Electric engine with a CVT for Hybrid.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you guide me step-by-step on how to book a test drive for the Aventro Swift Sedan?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For bookings or a test drive, contact your nearest Aventro dealership or service center\\\",\\n        \\\"Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd. Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018, India\\\",\\n        \\\"Phone: +91 124 1234567\\\",\\n        \\\"Email: info@aventromotors.com\\\",\\n        \\\"Website: www.aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To book a test drive, first contact your nearest Aventro dealership or service center; you can call +91 124 1234567, email info@aventromotors.com, or visit www.aventromotors.com for further assistance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are your thoughts on the Aventro Swift Sedan's fuel efficiency and modern features?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Swift Sedan is an elegant and performance-driven sedan designed for Indian roads. With a blend of advanced safety, modern features, and fuel-efficient technology, the Swift promises comfort, technology, and style.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Aventro Swift Sedan is designed with fuel-efficient technology and modern features such as advanced safety systems and a stylish infotainment setup, making it a compelling choice for comfort and performance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm trying to access the online booking portal on your website but I keep getting an error message. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"\",\"37\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you tell me what discount levels are available for corporate purchases and how the fleet purchase discount is structured?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"General Corporate Discount: 2% - 5% off on ex-showroom price (varying by model, quantity, and corporate tie-up).\\\",\\n        \\\"Fleet Purchase Discount: 5% - 8% off for purchase of 5+ vehicles in a single order.\\\",\\n        \\\"Additional Benefits: - Free 1st year maintenance package. - Complimentary accessories kit on select models. - Priority delivery slots.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For corporate purchases, Aventro Motors offers a General Corporate Discount of 2% - 5% off on the ex-showroom price and a Fleet Purchase Discount of 5% - 8% off for orders of 5 or more vehicles, along with benefits such as a free 1st year maintenance package, a complimentary accessories kit on select models, and priority delivery slots.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What documents do I need to provide to avail the corporate discount, and what additional benefits can I get with it?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Valid Corporate ID Proof \\/ Letter from HR or Procurement Head.\\\",\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Company-issued Purchase Order (PO) or undertaking.\\\",\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Employee ID Proof (for individual employee schemes).\\\",\\n        \\\"Additional Benefits - Free 1st year maintenance package.\\\",\\n        \\\"Additional Benefits - Complimentary accessories kit on select models.\\\",\\n        \\\"Additional Benefits - Priority delivery slots.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To avail the corporate discount, you need to provide a valid Corporate ID Proof or a letter from HR\\/Procurement Head, a company-issued Purchase Order (PO) or undertaking, and an Employee ID Proof. Additionally, you can benefit from a free 1st year maintenance package, a complimentary accessories kit on select models, and priority delivery slots.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide me with a step-by-step guide on how to apply for the government discount?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Eligibility - Applicable to Central\\/State Government organizations, PSUs, Public Sector Banks, Municipal Corporations, and accredited government officials.\\\",\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Official Purchase Order or Sanction Letter (institutional purchase).\\\",\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Valid Government photo ID\\/Service Card (for personal purchase).\\\",\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Departmental recommendation letter (if needed).\\\",\\n        \\\"Additional Perks - Priority processing for order and registration. - Fast-track delivery support. - Complimentary basic kit.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To apply for the government discount, first verify that you are eligible as a Central\\/State Government organization, PSU, Public Sector Bank, Municipal Corporation, or an accredited government official. Next, gather the necessary documents, which include an Official Purchase Order or Sanction Letter, a Valid Government photo ID\\/Service Card (for personal purchases), and a Departmental recommendation letter if needed. Finally, submit these documents to benefit from additional perks such as priority processing, fast-track delivery support, and a complimentary basic kit.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your opinion, how does the discount structure of Aventro Motors benefit corporate buyers compared to government buyers?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"General Corporate Discount: 2% - 5% off on ex-showroom price (varying by model, quantity, and corporate tie-up).\\\",\\n        \\\"Fleet Purchase Discount: 5% - 8% off for purchase of 5+ vehicles in a single order.\\\",\\n        \\\"Additional Benefits: - Free 1st year maintenance package. - Complimentary accessories kit on select models. - Priority delivery slots.\\\",\\n        \\\"Direct Government Order: 3% - 7% off on ex-showroom price.\\\",\\n        \\\"Public Sector Employees: 2% - 5% off on ex-showroom price (on submission of valid official ID).\\\",\\n        \\\"Defence\\/Police\\/Paramilitary Personnel: Additional \\u20b910,000 - \\u20b920,000 benefit (model-specific).\\\",\\n        \\\"Additional Perks: - Priority processing for order and registration. - Fast-track delivery support. - Complimentary basic kit.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors offers a structured approach for both corporate and government buyers. Corporate buyers receive a 2% - 5% off discount on general purchases and a 5% - 8% off fleet purchase discount, along with benefits like a free 1st year maintenance package, complimentary accessories kit, and priority delivery slots. Government buyers, on the other hand, can benefit from a 3% - 7% discount on direct orders, 2% - 5% off for public sector employees, and an additional \\u20b910,000 - \\u20b920,000 benefit for Defence\\/Police\\/Paramilitary personnel, as well as perks like priority processing and fast-track delivery support.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I placed an order under our corporate tie-up but I'm not receiving the promised discount. Is there an issue with my discount calculation?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Discount Structure - Discount amount and benefits at discretion of Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd. and can vary by region\\/dealership.\\\",\\n        \\\"Terms & Conditions - Corporate discounts cannot be clubbed with some seasonal offers, promotional rebates, or exchange bonuses.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The discount amount and benefits are at the discretion of Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd. and can vary by region or dealership. Also note that corporate discounts cannot be clubbed with certain seasonal offers, promotional rebates, or exchange bonuses, which might be affecting your discount calculation.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"gvt disc info pls? how do I get it?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Eligibility - Applicable to Central\\/State Government organizations, PSUs, Public Sector Banks, Municipal Corporations, and accredited government officials.\\\",\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Official Purchase Order or Sanction Letter (institutional purchase).\\\",\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Valid Government photo ID\\/Service Card (for personal purchase).\\\",\\n        \\\"Documents Required - Departmental recommendation letter (if needed).\\\",\\n        \\\"Additional Perks - Priority processing for order and registration. - Fast-track delivery support. - Complimentary basic kit.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For government discounts, ensure you meet the eligibility criteria as a Central\\/State Government organization, PSU, Public Sector Bank, Municipal Corporation, or accredited government official. Then, provide the required documents such as an Official Purchase Order or Sanction Letter, a Valid Government photo ID\\/Service Card (for personal purchases), and a Departmental recommendation letter if needed. This will also make you eligible for additional perks like priority processing, fast-track delivery support, and a complimentary basic kit.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"My competitor offers a 10% discount on fleet purchases. How does your fleet purchase discount compare?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Fleet Purchase Discount: 5% - 8% off for purchase of 5+ vehicles in a single order.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors offers a Fleet Purchase Discount of 5% - 8% off for the purchase of 5 or more vehicles in a single order.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I appreciate your prompt response time, but I feel the website interface is a bit outdated.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will investigate and work to improve our website\\u2019s performance.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"38\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is the price range for the Engine Assembly?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Engine Assembly          Complete engine unit                    \\u20b960,000 - \\u20b91,50,000\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Engine Assembly is a complete engine unit priced between \\u20b960,000 and \\u20b91,50,000.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you tell me the price range for the Brake Pads (Set of 4) and also if there's any warranty period mentioned for them?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Brake Pads (Set of 4)    Front & rear disc brake pads            \\u20b92,200 - \\u20b96,000\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Brake Pads (Set of 4) are priced between \\u20b92,200 and \\u20b96,000. No warranty period information is provided in the document.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How do I book the Roadside Assistance service?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Contact: +91 124 1234567\\\",\\n        \\\"Email: info@aventromotors.com\\\",\\n        \\\"Roadside Assistance      Towing, breakdown support, emergency repairs, etc.        \\u20b91,200 - \\u20b92,500 per call \\/ \\u20b93,500 annual membership\\\",\\n        \\\"For exact part\\/model-specific pricing, contact your nearest Aventro dealership or service center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To book Roadside Assistance, please call +91 124 1234567 or email info@aventromotors.com. The service is priced between \\u20b91,200 and \\u20b92,500 per call, or \\u20b93,500 annually. For further details, contact your nearest Aventro dealership or service center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm considering upgrading my infotainment system. What do you think about its performance and value?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Infotainment System      Touchscreen unit                        \\u20b910,000 - \\u20b940,000\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The infotainment system is offered as a touchscreen unit priced between \\u20b910,000 and \\u20b940,000.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I encountered a 404 error when trying to place an order for a Radiator part on your website. Can you help me resolve this issue?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Radiator                 Engine radiator                         \\u20b94,000 - \\u20b910,000\\\",\\n        \\\"Contact: +91 124 1234567\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For the Radiator, which is priced between \\u20b94,000 and \\u20b910,000, please contact our support team at +91 124 1234567 regarding the website error.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Plz hlp, can't access info@aventromotors.com, it dint work!\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Email: info@aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If you're having trouble, please try using the email address info@aventromotors.com for your inquiries.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I've seen a competitor offering engine assemblies at lower prices. Can you explain how your pricing stands?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd.  Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018, India\\\",\\n        \\\"Engine Assembly          Complete engine unit                    \\u20b960,000 - \\u20b91,50,000\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Our Engine Assembly is a complete engine unit priced between \\u20b960,000 and \\u20b91,50,000, and Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd. is located at Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018, India.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Your website layout is confusing and hard to navigate.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\",\"39\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How can I safely tow my electric Aventro car?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Warning! Never tow with wheels on the ground if your model is electric. Use a flatbed truck.\\\",\\n        \\\"Electric Vehicles: ONLY FLATBED TOWING. Do not tow with wheels on ground.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"For electric Aventro vehicles, you must use flatbed towing as towing with wheels on the ground is not allowed.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you tell me how to attach the tow hook properly, and also what should I do with an automatic transmission vehicle when towing?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Remove the Cover: Use a plastic pry tool or key to open the cover.\\\",\\n        \\\"Retrieve the Tow Hook: Found in your car\\u2019s tool kit or trunk. Screw in the Tow Hook: Insert into the exposed thread & rotate clockwise until tight.\\\",\\n        \\\"Automatic Transmission: Place in Neutral (N), release the parking brake. CAUTION: For automatics and hybrids, flatbed towing is recommended to avoid transmission damage.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"First, remove the tow hook cover using a plastic pry tool or key, then retrieve the tow hook from your car\\u2019s tool kit or trunk and screw it in by inserting it into the exposed thread and rotating clockwise until tight. For vehicles with automatic transmission, place the vehicle in Neutral, release the parking brake, and use flatbed towing to avoid transmission damage.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide a step-by-step guide on how to tow my Aventro car safely?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Check Owner\\u2019s Manual: Refer to your specific model's owner\\u2019s manual for any towing restrictions or recommendations.\\\",\\n        \\\"Step 1: Gather Necessary Tools - Tow strap or tow rope (rated for your car weight), Tow hook (provided with vehicle, usually in trunk\\/tool kit), Torch (for visibility at night), Warning triangle or cones.\\\",\\n        \\\"Step 2: Locate the Tow Hook Covers - Front and Rear Bumper: Look for small plastic covers on the bumper (often marked by a tow symbol). Remove the Cover: Use a plastic pry tool or key to open the cover.\\\",\\n        \\\"Step 3: Attach the Tow Hook - Retrieve the Tow Hook: Found in your car\\u2019s tool kit or trunk. Screw in the Tow Hook: Insert into the exposed thread & rotate clockwise until tight.\\\",\\n        \\\"Step 4: Connect the Tow Strap or Tow Rope - Attach to Tow Hook: Ensure the strap\\/rope is securely fastened to the tow hook. Other Vehicle: Attach the other end to the towing vehicle\\u2019s tow point.\\\",\\n        \\\"Step 5: Prepare the Vehicle for Towing - Manual Transmission: Place in Neutral, release the parking brake; Automatic Transmission: Place in Neutral (N), release the parking brake. CAUTION: For automatics and hybrids, flatbed towing is recommended to avoid transmission damage; Electric Vehicles: ONLY FLATBED TOWING. Do not tow with wheels on ground.\\\",\\n        \\\"Step 6: Safety Measures - Place warning triangle\\/cones at a safe distance behind both vehicles, Switch ON hazard lights on both vehicles, Ensure both drivers agree on signaling and communication.\\\",\\n        \\\"Step 7: Towing - The towing vehicle should accelerate slowly \\u2013 no sudden jerks, Maximum speed should not exceed 25 km\\/h, Keep the towed vehicle\\u2019s ignition ON (to prevent steering lock and allow brake assist), Steer and brake gently in the towed vehicle.\\\",\\n        \\\"Step 8: After Towing - Park both vehicles safely, Unscrew the tow hook and store it back with your tools, Replace the plastic tow hook cover.\\\",\\n        \\\"Important Safety Notice - Never tow on highways unless necessary. Do not allow passengers in the towed vehicle. If in doubt, use Aventro Roadside Assistance or professional towing.\\\",\\n        \\\"Contact Aventro Motors Roadside Assistance - Phone: +91 124 1234567, Email: info@aventromotors.com.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"First, refer to your owner\\u2019s manual for any towing restrictions. Gather necessary tools including a tow strap, tow hook, torch, and warning triangles. Locate the tow hook covers on the front and rear bumpers and remove the cover using a plastic pry tool or key. Retrieve the tow hook from the tool kit or trunk and screw it in by inserting it into the exposed thread and rotating clockwise until tight. Connect the tow strap to the tow hook and attach the other end to the towing vehicle\\u2019s tow point. For manual transmissions, place the vehicle in Neutral and release the parking brake; for automatic transmissions, do the same but use\",\"40\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What are the exact steps to start my Aventro Petrol car using the push-button start method?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Ensure Safety First - Sit in the driver\\u2019s seat and fasten your seatbelt. Ensure the gear lever is in 'P' (Park, for automatic) or 'N' (Neutral, for manual). Press the brake pedal (and the clutch for manual transmission).\\\",\\n        \\\"Ensure Key Fob is Inside the Car - The key fob should be in your pocket or bag within the vehicle.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press the Start\\/Stop Button - Press and hold the brake pedal. Press the \\\\\\\"Start\\/Stop\\\\\\\" button. The engine will start.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To start your Aventro Petrol car with push-button start, first sit in the driver\\u2019s seat, fasten your seatbelt, ensure the gear lever is in 'P' or 'N', and press the brake (and clutch if manual). Then, make sure the key fob is inside the car, press and hold the brake pedal, and press the \\\\\\\"Start\\/Stop\\\\\\\" button to start the engine.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you explain how to start my Aventro Hybrid car and also tell me what to do if the 'READY' signal does not appear on the dashboard?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Ensure Safety First - Sit in the driver\\u2019s seat and fasten your seatbelt. Ensure the gear lever is in 'P' (Park, for automatic) or 'N' (Neutral, for manual). Press the brake pedal (and the clutch for manual transmission).\\\",\\n        \\\"Key Fob Present - Make sure the key fob is with you, inside the car.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press Brake Pedal - Press and hold the brake pedal.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press Start Button - Press the \\\\\\\"Start\\/Stop\\\\\\\" button. The car may start silently in EV mode or with a slight engine sound in engine mode. Watch for 'READY' signal on the dashboard.\\\",\\n        \\\"For electric\\/hybrid, if 'READY' does not appear, try restarting.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To start your Aventro Hybrid car, first sit in the driver\\u2019s seat, fasten your seatbelt, ensure the gear lever is in the correct position, and press the brake (and clutch if manual). Make sure the key fob is inside the car, then press and hold the brake pedal and press the \\\\\\\"Start\\/Stop\\\\\\\" button. The car may start either silently or with a slight engine sound, and you should watch for the 'READY' signal. If the 'READY' signal does not appear, try restarting the car.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide a step-by-step guide on how to start my Aventro Electric car?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Key Fob Present - Ensure the key fob is inside the vehicle.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press Brake Pedal - Firmly press and hold the brake pedal.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press Start Button - Press the \\\\\\\"Start\\/Stop\\\\\\\" button. Indicator lights and systems will activate.\\\",\\n        \\\"Ready Indicator - Wait for the 'READY' signal\\/light on the dashboard. The car is now ready to drive silently.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To start your Aventro Electric car, ensure the key fob is inside the vehicle, firmly press and hold the brake pedal, and then press the \\\\\\\"Start\\/Stop\\\\\\\" button so that indicator lights and systems activate. Finally, wait for the 'READY' signal on the dashboard, which indicates that the car is ready to drive silently.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"In your opinion, how user-friendly is the process of starting an Aventro car?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Starting your Aventro car is a simple process, but exact procedures may vary slightly depending on the model, fuel type, and technology (conventional, electric, or hybrid).\\\",\\n        \\\"Ensure Safety First - Sit in the driver\\u2019s seat and fasten your seatbelt.\\\",\\n        \\\"Do not press the accelerator while starting.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The process of starting an Aventro car is described as simple, with clear steps such as ensuring safety by fastening your seatbelt and not pressing the accelerator while starting. Procedures vary slightly based on the model and fuel type, but overall the approach is designed to be user-friendly.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"My Aventro Diesel car isn't starting even after I follow the key ignition process. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"If you're unsure or the car doesn't start, refer to your Aventro user manual or contact the nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"If your Aventro Diesel car doesn't start, you should refer to your Aventro user manual or contact the nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Hlw, can u pls lst out stps for strting my ev car? I cn't get it rt.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Key Fob Present - Ensure the key fob is inside the vehicle.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press Brake Pedal - Firmly press and hold the brake pedal.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press Start Button - Press the \\\\\\\"Start\\/Stop\\\\\\\" button. Indicator lights and systems will activate.\\\",\\n        \\\"Ready Indicator - Wait for the 'READY' signal\\/light on the\",\"41\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I need help preparing my car for safe driving. What should I check before starting my car?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Ensure you are well-rested and not under the influence of alcohol, drugs, or strong medication.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check weather and road conditions.\\\",\\n        \\\"Perform a quick walk-around inspection of the car: - Tire condition and pressure - All lights functioning (headlights, brake lights, indicators) - No visible leaks or loose parts.\\\",\\n        \\\"Adjust your seat, headrest, and mirrors for comfort and proper view.\\\",\\n        \\\"Fasten your seat belt and ensure all passengers are buckled up.\\\",\\n        \\\"Clear the windshield and mirrors of obstructions\\/dirt.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Before starting the car, you should ensure you are well-rested and not under the influence of alcohol, drugs, or strong medication, check weather and road conditions, perform a quick walk-around inspection of the car (including checking tire condition, lights, and for any leaks), adjust your seat, headrest, and mirrors for comfort and a proper view, fasten your seat belt and ensure all passengers are buckled up, and clear the windshield and mirrors of obstructions or dirt.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you explain how to safely start my car and also what precautions I should take while driving to avoid distractions?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Ensure the gear is in neutral\\/park.\\\",\\n        \\\"Press the brake pedal before starting.\\\",\\n        \\\"Check dashboard warning lights after ignition.\\\",\\n        \\\"Familiarize yourself with the location of controls (wipers, headlights, horn, indicators, hazard lights).\\\",\\n        \\\"Obey all speed limits and traffic rules.\\\",\\n        \\\"Use indicators when changing lanes or turning.\\\",\\n        \\\"Avoid distractions: - Do not use mobile phones unless hands-free. - Avoid eating, drinking, or reaching for objects while driving.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"When starting your car, ensure the gear is in neutral or park, press the brake pedal before starting, check the dashboard warning lights after ignition, and familiarize yourself with the location of controls. While driving, obey all speed limits and traffic rules, use indicators when changing lanes or turning, and avoid distractions such as using mobile phones, eating, drinking, or reaching for objects.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide a step-by-step guide on what I should do after reaching my destination?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Switch off the engine and lights.\\\",\\n        \\\"Lock all doors and secure valuables.\\\",\\n        \\\"Park safely without blocking exits, driveways, or fire lanes.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"After reaching your destination, switch off the engine and lights, lock all doors and secure valuables, and park safely without blocking exits, driveways, or fire lanes.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is your opinion on using headlights and low beams during adverse weather conditions?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Use headlights in low light, rain, or fog.\\\",\\n        \\\"Use low beams in fog or heavy rain.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The checklist advises using headlights in low light, rain, or fog and recommends using low beams in fog or heavy rain, highlighting the importance of proper headlight use for safe driving in adverse weather conditions.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"When I start my car, the dashboard warning lights remain on. What should I do according to the safe driving checklist?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Check dashboard warning lights after ignition.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"You should check the dashboard warning lights after ignition as advised in the checklist to ensure there are no issues with your vehicle.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"hw do i chk my mirrs? they're not clearing properly.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Clear the windshield and mirrors of obstructions\\/dirt.\\\",\\n        \\\"Continuously check rear-view and side mirrors.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Ensure you clear the windshield and mirrors of obstructions or dirt, and continuously check your rear-view and side mirrors.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does Aventro Service Center compare to other services for vehicle maintenance and roadside assistance?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For vehicle maintenance or emergency assistance, contact your nearest Aventro Service Center.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expect