ed_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors provides a reliable method for accessing your car when the remote battery is dead: use the hidden physical key by releasing it from the remote, locate the key slot (which may be exposed or covered), insert the key, and turn it clockwise to unlock the door, and then replace the remote battery as soon as possible.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I find the process to open my car door with a dead remote battery very confusing.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate your input and will work to improve the clarity of our instructions.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"46\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is the price range for the Infotainment System in both INR and Lakh?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"3    | Infotainment System | Touchscreen, Bluetooth, Android Auto\\/CarPlay  | 30,000 \\u2013 75,000               | 0.30 \\u2013 0.75\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Infotainment System is priced between 30,000 \\u2013 75,000 INR and 0.30 \\u2013 0.75 Lakh.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide the price details for the Radiator and the Bumper? Also, do the prices include GST and what about installation charges?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"6    | Radiator            | Aluminium core, OE specifications             | 8,000 \\u2013 18,000                | 0.08 \\u2013 0.18\\\",\\n        \\\"8    | Bumper              | Painted\\/Unpainted, OEM grade, front\\/rear      | 6,000 \\u2013 20,000                | 0.06 \\u2013 0.20\\\",\\n        \\\"Prices are inclusive of GST, exclusive of installation charges.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Radiator is priced between 8,000 \\u2013 18,000 INR (0.08 \\u2013 0.18 Lakh) and the Bumper is priced between 6,000 \\u2013 20,000 INR (0.06 \\u2013 0.20 Lakh). Prices are inclusive of GST and exclusive of installation charges.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you provide step-by-step guidance on how to contact Aventro Motors for repair inquiries and to find authorized service centers?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd.\\\",\\n        \\\"Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018, India\\\",\\n        \\\"Contact: +91 124 1234567\\\",\\n        \\\"Email: info@aventromotors.com\\\",\\n        \\\"[Find authorized service centers across India.](#)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To contact Aventro Motors, you can call +91 124 1234567 or email info@aventromotors.com. Additionally, click on the link 'Find authorized service centers across India.' for locating service centers.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is your opinion on the quality of the AC Compressor from Aventro Motors?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"4    | AC Compressor       | OEM rotary\\/vane, all variants                 | 12,000 \\u2013 25,000               | 0.12 \\u2013 0.25\\\",\\n        \\\"All parts are OEM grade and compatible with Aventro Motors models.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The AC Compressor is an OEM rotary\\/vane product, reflecting the high-quality standards of our OEM grade parts that are compatible with Aventro Motors models.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I tried ordering the Dashboard Display online but received an error and my payment did not go through. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"2    | Dashboard Display   | Digital LCD\\/Cluster Display Unit              | 25,000 \\u2013 45,000               | 0.25 \\u2013 0.45\\\",\\n        \\\"Contact: +91 124 1234567\\\",\\n        \\\"Email: info@aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Please contact our customer support at +91 124 1234567 or email info@aventromotors.com for assistance with your Dashboard Display order error.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"whats tho price fr seatss?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"9    | Seats               | Fabric\\/PU Leather, with recline, per piece    | 8,000 \\u2013 25,000                | 0.08 \\u2013 0.25\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Seats are priced between 8,000 \\u2013 25,000 INR and 0.08 \\u2013 0.25 Lakh.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How do your Infotainment Systems compare with competitor offerings in terms of price and quality?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"3    | Infotainment System | Touchscreen, Bluetooth, Android Auto\\/CarPlay  | 30,000 \\u2013 75,000               | 0.30 \\u2013 0.75\\\",\\n        \\\"All parts are OEM grade and compatible with Aventro Motors models.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Our Infotainment System is priced between 30,000 \\u2013 75,000 INR (0.30 \\u2013 0.75 Lakh) and is an OEM grade product, ensuring high quality and compatibility with Aventro Motors models.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I recently purchased a part and found the service to be unsatisfactory.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will investigate and work to improve our service.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"47\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you explain what Lane Keeping Assist System (LKAS) is and how it functions?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Lane Keeping Assist System (LKAS) is an advanced driver assistance system (ADAS) designed to enhance road safety by helping drivers keep their vehicles within marked lane boundaries.\\\",\\n        \\\"If the vehicle starts drifting toward a lane marking without indicating (using a turn signal), the system may give audible or visual warnings (e.g., a beep, steering wheel vibration, or dashboard alert).\\\",\\n        \\\"If the driver doesn\\u2019t respond to the warnings, LKAS can automatically provide gentle steering input to guide the car back toward the center of the lane.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Lane Keeping Assist System (LKAS) is an advanced driver assistance system (ADAS) designed to enhance road safety by helping drivers keep their vehicles within marked lane boundaries. It functions by warning the driver with audible or visual alerts if the vehicle starts drifting and, if necessary, automatically providing gentle steering input to bring the vehicle back to the center of the lane.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does LKAS detect lane markings and what happens if the driver ignores the warning? Also, can you mention if it works at all speeds?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Typically, a forward-facing camera mounted near the rear-view mirror scans the road ahead for lane markings (white\\/yellow lines).\\\",\\n        \\\"If the vehicle starts drifting toward a lane marking without indicating (using a turn signal), the system may give audible or visual warnings (e.g., a beep, steering wheel vibration, or dashboard alert).\\\",\\n        \\\"Some systems only work above certain speeds (e.g., above 60 km\\/h).\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"LKAS detects lane markings using a forward-facing camera mounted near the rear-view mirror that scans the road for white or yellow lines. If the driver ignores the warning after the system gives an audible or visual alert, the system takes no further action in this context, and it is noted that some systems only operate above certain speeds, such as above 60 km\\/h.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you please provide a step-by-step guide on how the LKAS system works from detecting lanes to actively correcting the vehicle's course?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Vehicle Camera Detects Lane\\\",\\n        \\\"Control Unit Monitors Position Relative to Lane Marks\\\",\\n        \\\"If Drift Detected: System Alerts Driver\\\",\\n        \\\"If No Response: System Gently Steers Vehicle Back to Lane Center\\\",\\n        \\\"The camera\\/system detects lane boundaries by analyzing road markings in real-time.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The LKAS system works as follows: First, the vehicle camera detects the lane by analyzing road markings in real-time. Next, the control unit monitors the vehicle's position relative to lane marks. If a drift is detected, the system alerts the driver. If the driver does not respond, the system gently steers the vehicle back to the lane center.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is your opinion on the LKAS feature? Do you think it sufficiently supports the driver during critical situations?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Reduces Accidents: Lane departures are a major cause of road accidents, especially due to driver drowsiness, distraction, or inattention.\\\",\\n        \\\"Enhances Safety: By consistently monitoring the vehicle\\u2019s position, LKAS can help avoid unintended drift into adjacent lanes.\\\",\\n        \\\"Supports the Driver: LKAS provides gentle steering inputs or alerts, acting as a backup to human oversight.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The LKAS feature is beneficial as it reduces accidents by preventing unintentional lane departures, enhances safety by consistently monitoring the vehicle's position, and supports the driver with gentle steering inputs or alerts during critical situations.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I noticed that my LKAS is not giving me any warning signals even when I start drifting. What could be the issue?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"If the vehicle starts drifting toward a lane marking without indicating (using a turn signal), the system may give audible or visual warnings (e.g., a beep, steering wheel vibration, or dashboard alert).\\\",\\n        \\\"Reliant on Lane Markings: LKAS requires clear, visible lane lines; performance may degrade in poor weather, faded markings, or during road construction.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The LKAS is designed to give audible or visual warnings if the vehicle drifts without indicating, but it is reliant on clear and visible lane markings. Poor weather, faded markings, or road construction could be causing the absence of warnings.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"lkas system not workin properly coz of bad lnes. fix pls?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Reliant on Lane Markings: LKAS requires clear, visible lane lines; performance may degrade in poor weather, faded markings, or during road construction.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The LKAS performance may be affected because it requires clear and visible lane lines, and its effectiveness can degrade in poor weather, faded markings, or during road construction.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does your LKAS technology compare to competitor systems, especially in terms of automatic steering correction and integration with other systems?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Automatic Steering Correction: Minor, smooth counter-steering to stay centered in the lane.\\\",\\n        \\\"Integrated with Other Systems: Often works alongside Lane Departure Warning (LDW) and Adaptive Cruise Control (ACC).\\\",\\n        \\\"LKAS provides gentle steering inputs or alerts, acting as a backup to human oversight.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Our LKAS technology features automatic steering correction through minor, smooth counter-steering to keep the vehicle centered in the lane, and it is integrated with other systems such as Lane Departure Warning (LDW) and Adaptive Cruise Control (ACC), providing gentle steering inputs or alerts as a backup to human oversight.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm not happy with the performance of the LKAS features on my vehicle, they sometimes seem too intrusive.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We will investigate and work to improve our service.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"48\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide detailed information on the awards Aventro Motors received in 2024?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"\\u201cCar Manufacturer of the Year\\u201d  *AutoTech India Awards 2024*  For consistent innovation and leadership in India\\u2019s passenger vehicle market.\\\",\\n        \\\"\\u201cBest Electric Vehicle Launch\\u201d  *Green Wheels Expo 2024*  Awarded for the successful launch of the Aventro Aero Electric variant.\\\",\\n        \\\"\\u201cBest Customer Service Experience\\u201d  *National Auto Customer Choice Awards 2024*  For outstanding after-sales and service center network across India.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"In 2024, Aventro Motors received the 'Car Manufacturer of the Year' award at AutoTech India Awards 2024 for consistent innovation and leadership in India\\u2019s passenger vehicle market, the 'Best Electric Vehicle Launch' award at Green Wheels Expo 2024 for the successful launch of the Aventro Aero Electric variant, and the 'Best Customer Service Experience' award at the National Auto Customer Choice Awards 2024 for its outstanding after-sales and service center network across India.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Compound Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Could you tell me which award Aventro Motors won in 2021 for their entry-level hatchback, and also what recognition they received for safety in 2023?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"\\u201cBest Entry-level Hatchback\\u201d  *Car Reviewers Guild of India 2021*  For Aventro Nova\\u2019s class-leading value, mileage, and features.\\\",\\n        \\\"\\u201cSafety Award \\u2013 Passenger Segment\\u201d  *SafeDrive India Conference 2023*  Recognizing Aventro Bolt\\u2019s industry-leading safety and crash-test ratings.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors was awarded 'Best Entry-level Hatchback' by the Car Reviewers Guild of India in 2021 for Aventro Nova\\u2019s class-leading value, mileage, and features, and in 2023, they received the 'Safety Award \\u2013 Passenger Segment' at the SafeDrive India Conference in recognition of Aventro Bolt\\u2019s industry-leading safety and crash-test ratings.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Instructional Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you guide me on how to access the awards and recognitions information for Aventro Motors?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For more information: Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd.  Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018, India  Email: info@aventromotors.com  Official Website: www.aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To access the awards and recognitions information, please visit the official website at www.aventromotors.com. You can also refer to the provided contact details for further guidance.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Opinion-Based Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"What is your opinion on Aventro Motors' commitment to sustainability and their CSR initiatives?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"\\u201cEco-Friendly Automaker of the Year\\u201d  *Clean Mobility India Awards 2023*  For introducing sustainable manufacturing practices and electric drivetrains.\\\",\\n        \\\"Recognized for CSR Initiatives in Automotive Sustainability, 2023.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors has demonstrated a strong commitment to sustainability, as evidenced by being honored as the 'Eco-Friendly Automaker of the Year' at the Clean Mobility India Awards 2023 for their sustainable manufacturing practices and electric drivetrains, and through their recognition for CSR Initiatives in Automotive Sustainability in 2023.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Error\\/Issue Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"I'm encountering an error when I try to view the awards section on your website. What should I do?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For more information: Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd.  Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018, India  Email: info@aventromotors.com  Official Website: www.aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"We\\u2019re sorry you\\u2019re experiencing difficulties. Please reach out to our support team via email at info@aventromotors.com for assistance with accessing the awards section on our website.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Edge-Case & Error Handling Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can u pls hlp me wt my awrds scrn?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"For more information: Aventro Motors Pvt. Ltd.  Aventro Tower, Sector 18, Gurgaon, Haryana - 122018, India  Email: info@aventromotors.com  Official Website: www.aventromotors.com\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"To view the awards information, please visit our official website at www.aventromotors.com and navigate to the relevant section.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Competitor Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"How does Aventro Motors' customer service stand out compared to other manufacturers?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"\\u201cBest Customer Service Experience\\u201d  *National Auto Customer Choice Awards 2024*  For outstanding after-sales and service center network across India.\\\",\\n        \\\"\\u201cCustomer First: Aventro\\u2019s Service Network Success Story\\u201d  \\u2013 AutoCar India, July 2023\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Aventro Motors' customer service stands out as they received the 'Best Customer Service Experience' award at the National Auto Customer Choice Awards 2024 for their outstanding after-sales and service center network, and they were featured in AutoCar India's 'Customer First: Aventro\\u2019s Service Network Success Story', underscoring their exceptional service.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Feedback Related Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Your website feels too cluttered and confusing.\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"Thank you for your feedback. We appreciate your input and will work to improve your experience.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"49\":\"{\\n  \\\"items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"Specific Query\\\",\\n      \\\"query_text\\\": \\\"Can you provide detailed specifications and pricing for the Diesel ZX variant of the Aventro Bolt Sedan?\\\",\\n      \\\"facts\\\": [\\n        \\\"Diesel     | ZX     | Same as Petrol ZX, Diesel engine                                                                     | 11.2\\\",\\n        \\\"360\\u00b0 surround view camera, 11-inch infotainment system with Harmon premium audio, ADAS Level 2 (Auto Emergency Braking, Enhanced Lane Keep Assist, Adaptive Cruise), Powered leather seats, Powered sunroof\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"expected_answer\\\": \\\"The Diesel ZX variant is the same as Petrol ZX with a Diesel engine and is priced at 11.2 Lakh \\u20b9, featuring a 360\\u00b0 surround view camera, 11-inch infotainment system with Harmon premium audio, ADAS\"}}"